cn-math-taxonomy_09998,xiaoyang111222/cn-math-taxonomy,questions.json,六年级,英语,下,六年级下册 第2单元 Last weekend,用过去式说周末安排,选择题,基础,0.3,basic,I didn't go out. I had a cold. 我怎么了？,"[""去看电影了"", ""去公园了"", ""很开心出门"", ""感冒了，没出门""]",感冒了，没出门,had a cold; didn't go out。,[]
cn-math-taxonomy_09999,xiaoyang111222/cn-math-taxonomy,questions.json,六年级,英语,下,六年级下册 第2单元 Last weekend,用过去式说周末安排,选择题,中等,0.55,standard,哪一组能完整谈上周末？,"[""I cleaning now only."", ""Clean room I yesterday."", ""I cleaned my room. It was good."", ""I clean my room tomorrow.""]",I cleaned my room. It was good.,过去式 + 评价。,[]
