congcong-school_37589,congcong-school,english-g3up-2026/lessons/english-g3up-2026-u7-kp1.json,三年级,英语,全,礼貌做客与综合交际,礼貌做客与综合交际,选择题,基础,0.38,2,你想去朋友家做客，还没有得到爸爸妈妈的同意。下面哪一种安排最合适？,"[""出发前向爸爸妈妈询问“Can I go?”，离开朋友家时说“Goodbye!”。"", ""出发前向爸爸妈妈说“Goodbye!”就走，不询问能否去。"", ""出发前不告诉爸爸妈妈，离开朋友家时也不告别。"", ""到朋友家后独占玩具，离开时不理睬朋友。""]",A,第77页先提示“Ask Mum and Dad.”，可用“Can I go?”向父母询问能否去；离开朋友家时用“Goodbye!”告别。,"[""礼貌做客与综合交际""]"
congcong-school_37590,congcong-school,english-g3up-2026/lessons/english-g3up-2026-u7-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,综合词汇与情境阅读,综合词汇与情境阅读,选择题,基础,0.25,1,哪一个英文单词表示“耳朵”？,"[""arm"", ""eye"", ""hand"", ""ear""]",D,“ear”表示耳朵；其余三个词分别表示手臂、眼睛和手。,"[""综合词汇与情境阅读""]"
congcong-school_37591,congcong-school,english-g3up-2026/lessons/english-g3up-2026-u7-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,综合词汇与情境阅读,综合词汇与情境阅读,判断题,基础,0.25,1,单词“mouth”表示“嘴”。,,对,“mouth”的中文意思是“嘴”。,"[""综合词汇与情境阅读""]"
congcong-school_37592,congcong-school,english-g3up-2026/lessons/english-g3up-2026-u7-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,综合词汇与情境阅读,综合词汇与情境阅读,选择题,基础,0.38,2,题面信息：这些小猫有黑色、橙色和白色三种颜色。回答“What colours are the baby cats?”，应选哪句？,"[""They are orange and brown."", ""They are black and white."", ""They are yellow, brown and red."", ""They are black, orange and white.""]",D,题面说明小猫有黑色、橙色和白色，因此应选择包含这三种颜色的回答。,"[""综合词汇与情境阅读""]"
congcong-school_37593,congcong-school,english-g3up-2026/lessons/english-g3up-2026-u7-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,综合词汇与情境阅读,综合词汇与情境阅读,选择题,基础,0.38,2,桌上有四个橙子。下面哪句话与这条信息相符？,"[""There are four bananas."", ""There are four oranges."", ""There are three apples."", ""There are five oranges.""]",B,“four”表示四，“oranges”表示橙子，只有该项同时符合水果种类和数量。,"[""综合词汇与情境阅读""]"
congcong-school_37594,congcong-school,english-g3up-2026/lessons/english-g3up-2026-u7-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,综合词汇与情境阅读,综合词汇与情境阅读,判断题,基础,0.25,1,“It's a bear.”的意思是“它是一只老虎”。,,错,“It's a bear.”表示“它是一只熊”。“老虎”对应的英文是“tiger”。,"[""综合词汇与情境阅读""]"
congcong-school_37595,congcong-school,english-g3up-2026/lessons/english-g3up-2026-u7-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,综合词汇与情境阅读,综合词汇与情境阅读,选择题,基础,0.38,2,朋友说：“这些花缺水了，请帮忙给花浇水。”孩子们可以怎样帮忙？,"[""They can plant the flowers."", ""They can water the flowers."", ""They can water the trees."", ""They can plant the trees.""]",B,题面明确说明需要给花浇水。“water the flowers”表示给花浇水，其他选项的动作或对象不符合。,"[""综合词汇与情境阅读""]"
congcong-school_37596,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-exam.json,三年级,英语,全,第 1 单元挑战,Lesson 1 Hello!,选择题,基础,0.25,1,一个玩偶说：“Hello! I'm Danny.”它介绍的姓名是哪一个？,"[""Hello"", ""Danny"", ""Jenny"", ""Li Ming""]",B,“I'm Danny.”表示说话者介绍自己叫Danny；Hello是问候语，其他两个姓名没有出现在这句自我介绍中。,"[""Lesson 1 Hello!""]"
congcong-school_37597,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-exam.json,三年级,英语,全,第 1 单元挑战,Lesson 2 How are you?,选择题,基础,0.38,2,小林要依次完成“早晨问候—询问近况—告别”这三个交流任务，哪组表达的顺序正确？,"[""Goodbye! → How are you? → Good morning."", ""Good morning. → How are you? → Goodbye!"", ""How are you? → Goodbye! → Good morning."", ""Good morning. → Goodbye! → How are you?""]",B,题目要求依次完成早晨问候、询问近况、告别。只有这一项的三个表达与要求逐一对应。,"[""Lesson 2 How are you?""]"
congcong-school_37598,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-exam.json,三年级,英语,全,第 1 单元挑战,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,选择题,基础,0.38,2,下午，小林见到张老师，要说“下午好，张老师”。哪一句准确表达这个意思？,"[""Good morning, Miss Zhang."", ""Good afternoon, Jenny."", ""Goodbye, Miss Zhang."", ""Good afternoon, Miss Zhang.""]",D,下午好用Good afternoon表示；直接称呼张老师时使用Miss Zhang。其他选项或时段不符，或姓名不符，或是在告别。,"[""Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.""]"
congcong-school_37599,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-exam.json,三年级,英语,全,第 1 单元挑战,"Lesson 4 Again, please!",选择题,基础,0.38,2,"姓名卡交流中，一个角色说：“Hi, Danny. I'm Liu Yubin.”这两句话依次表达什么？","[""先介绍自己叫Danny，再向Liu Yubin问好"", ""先向Danny告别，再介绍自己叫Liu Yubin"", ""先向Danny问好，再介绍自己叫Liu Yubin"", ""先询问Danny的近况，再表示感谢""]",C,"Hi, Danny.是在向Danny问好；I'm Liu Yubin.是在介绍说话者自己的姓名，不是在介绍Danny的姓名。","[""Lesson 4 Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_37600,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-exam.json,三年级,英语,全,第 1 单元挑战,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,判断题,基础,0.25,1,判断正误：“Good morning.”和“Good afternoon.”都表示“下午好”。,,错,Good morning.表示早上好；Good afternoon.表示下午好。两个表达对应的时段不同。,"[""Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.""]"
congcong-school_37601,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-exam.json,三年级,英语,全,第 1 单元挑战,"Lesson 4 Again, please!",判断题,基础,0.38,2,"判断下面的近况交流是否衔接正确。甲：“How are you?”乙：“Fine, thank you. And you?”甲：“I'm fine. Thank you.”",,对,这段对话先询问近况，再回答并致谢、反问，最后回答反问，问答衔接正确。,"[""Lesson 4 Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_37602,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp1.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 Hello!,Lesson 1 Hello!,选择题,基础,0.25,1,下面哪一项是表示“你好”的英语问候语，而不是人物姓名？,"[""Jenny"", ""Hello!"", ""Danny"", ""Li Ming""]",B,Hello!表示你好；其余三项都是教材人物的姓名，不是问候语。,"[""Lesson 1 Hello!""]"
congcong-school_37603,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp1.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 Hello!,Lesson 1 Hello!,选择题,基础,0.25,1,同伴见面时说“Hi!”，这里的意思是哪一个？,"[""我叫珍妮。"", ""谢谢你。"", ""你好！"", ""再见！""]",C,Hi!用于打招呼，意思是你好，不包含自我介绍、致谢或告别的意思。,"[""Lesson 1 Hello!""]"
congcong-school_37604,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp1.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 Hello!,Lesson 1 Hello!,选择题,基础,0.25,1,扮演Danny的同学要说“你好！我叫Danny。”请选择合适的部分补全：“Hello! ______ Danny.”,"[""Jenny"", ""I'm"", ""Hello"", ""Hi""]",B,介绍自己使用I'm加姓名。其余词不能放在这里组成题目要求的自我介绍。,"[""Lesson 1 Hello!""]"
congcong-school_37605,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp1.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 Hello!,Lesson 1 Hello!,选择题,基础,0.38,2,角色扮演中，一个虚构角色叫Lily。她要先打招呼，再完整介绍自己的姓名，哪一句正确？,"[""Hi! I'm Lily."", ""Hi! I Lily."", ""Hi! I'm."", ""Hi! Lily I'm.""]",A,Hi!用于问候，I'm Lily.介绍自己的姓名。其余选项缺少必要成分或词序不正确。,"[""Lesson 1 Hello!""]"
congcong-school_37606,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp1.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 Hello!,Lesson 1 Hello!,判断题,基础,0.25,1,判断正误：同伴见面打招呼时，可以说“Hello!”，也可以说“Hi!”。,,对,Hello!和Hi!都是本课的问候语，可以用于同伴见面时打招呼。,"[""Lesson 1 Hello!""]"
congcong-school_37607,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp1.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 Hello!,Lesson 1 Hello!,判断题,基础,0.25,1,判断正误：抄写“I'm Jenny.”时，可以把I'm写成Im。,,错,I'm中的撇号是缩写的一部分，不能省去写成Im。,"[""Lesson 1 Hello!""]"
congcong-school_37608,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 2 How are you?,Lesson 2 How are you?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,小禾早晨到校，想对同伴说“早上好”。哪一句准确表达这个意思？,"[""Goodbye!"", ""Good morning."", ""How are you?"", ""Thank you.""]",B,Good morning.准确表示早上好；其他选项分别表示告别、询问近况和致谢。,"[""Lesson 2 How are you?""]"
congcong-school_37609,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 2 How are you?,Lesson 2 How are you?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,小禾想用一句问句询问同伴近况，应选择哪一句？,"[""I'm Jenny."", ""Thank you."", ""How are you?"", ""Bye!""]",C,How are you?用于询问对方近况。其他选项分别是自我介绍、致谢和告别。,"[""Lesson 2 How are you?""]"
congcong-school_37610,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 2 How are you?,Lesson 2 How are you?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,朋友询问近况后，小禾要回答“我很好，谢谢你”。哪一句完整表达这两个意思？,"[""Good morning."", ""I'm fine. Thank you."", ""Goodbye!"", ""How are you?""]",B,I'm fine.表示我很好，Thank you.表示谢谢。其他选项不同时包含这两个意思。,"[""Lesson 2 How are you?""]"
congcong-school_37611,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 2 How are you?,Lesson 2 How are you?,选择题,基础,0.38,2,小禾已经回答自己很好并表示感谢，现在想接着问“你呢？”。应说哪一句？,"[""Bye!"", ""I'm fine."", ""Thank you."", ""And you?""]",D,And you?在这里表示你呢，用于反问对方的近况。其余选项不是反问。,"[""Lesson 2 How are you?""]"
congcong-school_37612,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 2 How are you?,Lesson 2 How are you?,判断题,基础,0.25,1,"判断正误：别人询问近况时，可以用“Fine, thank you.”回答自己很好并致谢。",,对,"Fine, thank you.是本课出现的近况回答，意思是很好，谢谢你。","[""Lesson 2 How are you?""]"
congcong-school_37613,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp2.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 2 How are you?,Lesson 2 How are you?,判断题,基础,0.25,1,判断正误：“Goodbye!”可以用于告别，但“Bye!”不能用于告别。,,错,Goodbye!和Bye!都可以用于告别，不能把Bye!判为不是告别语。,"[""Lesson 2 How are you?""]"
congcong-school_37614,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp3.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,要表达“下午好”，请选择合适的词补全：“Good ______.”,"[""morning"", ""fine"", ""afternoon"", ""you""]",C,Good afternoon.表示下午好。morning表示早晨，其他两项不能补成题目要求的问候语。,"[""Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.""]"
congcong-school_37615,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp3.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,两位新同伴初次见面，其中一位说：“Nice to meet you.”这句话的意思是什么？,"[""你好吗？"", ""很高兴认识你。"", ""早上好。"", ""再见！""]",B,Nice to meet you.用于初次见面致意，意思是很高兴认识你，不是询问近况或告别。,"[""Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.""]"
congcong-school_37616,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp3.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,"甲说：“Nice to meet you.”乙想说“我也很高兴认识你”，请补全：“Nice to meet you, ______.”","[""you"", ""fine"", ""too"", ""to""]",C,回应句末尾使用too，表示也。to、you、fine均不能填在这里构成正确回应。,"[""Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.""]"
congcong-school_37617,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp3.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,选择题,基础,0.38,2,角色扮演中，一个虚构角色叫Tom。他要表达“下午好。我叫Tom。”哪一句同时准确表达这两个意思？,"[""Good afternoon. I'm Tom."", ""Good morning. I'm Tom."", ""Good afternoon. I'm Jenny."", ""Good afternoon, Tom.""]",A,Good afternoon.表示下午好，I'm Tom.介绍自己叫Tom。其余选项或时段不符，或姓名不符，或没有完成自我介绍。,"[""Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.""]"
congcong-school_37618,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp3.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,判断题,基础,0.25,1,"判断正误：“Good afternoon, Miss Zhang.”是在向张老师问下午好。",,对,Good afternoon.表示下午好，后面的Miss Zhang是在直接称呼张老师。,"[""Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.""]"
congcong-school_37619,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp3.json,三年级,英语,全,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.,判断题,基础,0.38,2,判断正误：“Nice to meet you.”与“How are you?”意思相同，都在询问对方近况。,,错,Nice to meet you.表示很高兴认识你；询问近况要使用How are you?。,"[""Lesson 3 Nice to meet you.""]"
congcong-school_37620,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp4.json,三年级,英语,全,"Lesson 4 Again, please!","Lesson 4 Again, please!",选择题,基础,0.38,2,姓名卡活动中，甲扮演Amy，乙扮演Ben。甲已向乙问好。乙要用“你好！我叫Ben。”回应，哪一句准确？,"[""Hi, Ben."", ""Hi! I'm Ben."", ""Hi! I'm Amy."", ""Bye! I'm Ben.""]",B,Hi!完成问候，I'm Ben.完成Ben的自我介绍。其余选项或介绍了错误姓名，或只称呼对方，或使用告别语。,"[""Lesson 4 Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_37621,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp4.json,三年级,英语,全,"Lesson 4 Again, please!","Lesson 4 Again, please!",选择题,基础,0.38,2,两个虚构角色交流：说话者叫Ben，他正向Amy问好并介绍自己。哪句话中的两个姓名位置都正确？,"[""Hi, Ben. I'm Amy."", ""Hi, Amy. I'm Amy."", ""Hi, Amy. I'm Ben."", ""Hi, Ben. I'm Ben.""]",C,"Hi, Amy.是在问候Amy，I'm Ben.说明说话者叫Ben。其余选项没有同时正确对应被问候者和说话者。","[""Lesson 4 Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_37622,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp4.json,三年级,英语,全,"Lesson 4 Again, please!","Lesson 4 Again, please!",选择题,基础,0.25,1,新同伴说：“Nice to meet you.”你要回应“我也很高兴认识你”，而不是回答近况。应选哪一句？,"[""Fine, thank you."", ""And you?"", ""Bye!"", ""Nice to meet you, too.""]",D,"题目要求表达我也很高兴认识你，只有Nice to meet you, too.符合。其他选项分别是近况回答、反问和告别。","[""Lesson 4 Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_37623,congcong-school,english-g3up-54-luke/lessons/english-g3up-54-luke-u1-kp4.json,三年级,英语,全,"Lesson 4 Again, please!","Lesson 4 Again, please!",选择题,基础,0.38,2,甲问乙近况。乙要一次完成“回答很好、表示感谢、反问甲近况”三个任务，哪一项最完整？,"[""Fine, thank you. And you?"", ""Fine, thank you."", ""And you?"", ""Nice to meet you, too.""]",A,Fine回答自己很好，thank you表示感谢，And you?反问对方。其他选项都缺少题目要求的一个或多个交流内容。,"[""Lesson 4 Again, please!""]"
