congcong-school_38338,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp1.json,四年级,英语,全,Can you clean the windows?,Can you clean the windows?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,做家务时，小林说“I can’t do it well.”。这句话准确表达了什么意思？,"[""要求别人停止做家务。"", ""不能把这件事做好。"", ""能把这件事做好。"", ""不愿意做任何家务。""]",B,can’t do it well表示不能做好。它不等于能做好，也不是不愿做，更没有要求别人停止。,"[""Can you clean the windows?""]"
congcong-school_38339,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp1.json,四年级,英语,全,Can you clean the windows?,Can you clean the windows?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,你想提议“让我们一起做家务吧”，应选哪句话？,"[""Where’s dad?"", ""I’m watering the flowers."", ""Lunch is ready."", ""Let’s do housework.""]",D,Let’s do housework.是提议一起做家务。其他选项分别询问位置、描述浇花和表示午饭准备好了。,"[""Can you clean the windows?""]"
congcong-school_38340,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp1.json,四年级,英语,全,Can you clean the windows?,Can you clean the windows?,选择题,基础,0.38,2,一次家务能力调查记录：Amy会清洁地板，不会擦窗户。哪组报告与记录完全相符？,"[""Amy can clean the floor. She can clean the windows."", ""Amy can’t clean the floor. She can clean the windows."", ""Amy can clean the floor. She can’t clean the windows."", ""Amy can’t clean the floor. She can’t clean the windows.""]",C,已知Amy会清洁地板、不会擦窗户，只有第三项同时符合这两条信息。其余三项至少有一条能力信息与题干相反。,"[""Can you clean the windows?""]"
congcong-school_38341,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp2.json,四年级,英语,全,What are you doing?,What are you doing?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,你此刻正在洗衣服。补全描述：I’m _____ clothes now.,"[""wash"", ""washing"", ""to wash"", ""washes""]",B,am后使用washing表达正在洗衣。wash、washes和to wash均不能构成本句所需的现在进行时。,"[""What are you doing?""]"
congcong-school_38342,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp2.json,四年级,英语,全,What are you doing?,What are you doing?,选择题,基础,0.38,2,你想确认朋友此刻是否正在浇花，而不是问他会不会浇花。应选哪一句？,"[""Can you water the flowers?"", ""Where are the flowers?"", ""Are you watering the flowers?"", ""I’m watering the flowers.""]",C,询问对方是否正在浇花，用Are you watering the flowers?。第一项问能力，第三项问位置，第四项是描述自己的陈述句。,"[""What are you doing?""]"
congcong-school_38343,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp2.json,四年级,英语,全,What are you doing?,What are you doing?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,朋友问你“Are you cooking the meal?”，你现在没有做饭。选择规范的否定简答。,"[""No, I can’t."", ""Yes, I am."", ""No, I don’t."", ""No, I’m not.""]",D,"对Are you…?作个人否定简答用No, I’m not.。Yes, I am.与事实相反；其余两项使用can和do，不符合问句。","[""What are you doing?""]"
congcong-school_38344,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp2.json,四年级,英语,全,What are you doing?,What are you doing?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,补全询问对方当前动作的问句：What _____ you doing?,"[""is"", ""am"", ""are"", ""can""]",C,主语you与are搭配，构成What are you doing?；am与I搭配，is不能与you搭配，can不能直接接doing。,"[""What are you doing?""]"
congcong-school_38345,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp2.json,四年级,英语,全,What are you doing?,What are you doing?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,对话为：“Where’s dad?”“He’s in the kitchen.”。根据这组对话，爸爸在哪里？,"[""在卧室里"", ""在厨房里"", ""在花园里"", ""在教室里""]",B,He’s in the kitchen.说明爸爸在厨房。其余位置均未出现在给定回答中。,"[""What are you doing?""]"
congcong-school_38346,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp2.json,四年级,英语,全,What are you doing?,What are you doing?,判断题,基础,0.38,2,判断对错：“I can cook the meal.”本身就表示“我此刻正在做饭”。,,错,I can cook the meal.表达会做饭，并不说明此刻正在做饭；当前动作应使用I’m cooking the meal.。,"[""What are you doing?""]"
congcong-school_38347,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp3.json,四年级,英语,全,What's mum doing?,What's mum doing?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Mum正在洗碗。补全描述：_____ washing the dishes.,"[""We’re"", ""I’m"", ""She’s"", ""He’s""]",C,Mum用she指代，She is可缩写为She’s。He’s指男性；I’m指说话人；We’re指我们。,"[""What's mum doing?""]"
congcong-school_38348,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp3.json,四年级,英语,全,What's mum doing?,What's mum doing?,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Ben是一名男孩，现在正在浇花。哪句话准确描述他此刻的动作？,"[""He’s watering the flowers."", ""She’s watering the flowers."", ""He can water the flowers."", ""He’s washing the dishes.""]",A,题干明确Ben是男孩且正在浇花。第一项人物和动作均正确；第二项代词错误，第三项表达能力，第四项动作错误。,"[""What's mum doing?""]"
congcong-school_38349,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp3.json,四年级,英语,全,What's mum doing?,What's mum doing?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选择语法正确、用于询问爸爸正在做什么的问句。,"[""What are dad doing?"", ""What’s dad do?"", ""What dad is doing?"", ""What’s dad doing?""]",D,单个人物dad用is，What is可缩写为What’s；其他选项分别误用了are、原形do或错误语序。,"[""What's mum doing?""]"
congcong-school_38350,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp3.json,四年级,英语,全,What's mum doing?,What's mum doing?,选择题,基础,0.38,2,两位女孩都没有在玩电脑游戏。有人问她们“Are you playing computer games?”，她们一起作规范的否定简答，应选哪项？,"[""No, I’m not."", ""No, we aren’t."", ""No, we can’t."", ""Yes, we are.""]",B,两位女孩共同作答使用we；问题以Are开头，否定简答用aren’t。其余选项与人数、问句形式或否定事实不符。,"[""What's mum doing?""]"
congcong-school_38351,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp3.json,四年级,英语,全,What's mum doing?,What's mum doing?,判断题,基础,0.25,1,判断对错：句子“What’s she doing?”中，What’s需要撇号，句末需要问号。,,对,What’s是What is的缩写，撇号不可遗漏；该句询问正在做什么，句末用问号。,"[""What's mum doing?""]"
congcong-school_38352,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp3.json,四年级,英语,全,What's mum doing?,What's mum doing?,选择题,基础,0.25,1,今天是妈妈的生日。你想直接向她送上生日祝福，应说哪句话？,"[""Wait a minute, mum."", ""Lunch is ready, mum."", ""Happy birthday, mum!"", ""Come and help, mum.""]",C,"Happy birthday, mum!是对妈妈的生日祝福。其他选项分别表示稍等、午饭准备好了和过来帮忙，不是生日祝福。","[""What's mum doing?""]"
congcong-school_38353,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp4.json,四年级,英语,全,"Again, please!","Again, please!",选择题,基础,0.38,2,小杰正在做面包。补全他的描述：I’m _____ bread.,"[""make"", ""makes"", ""making"", ""to make""]",C,am后接动词-ing表达正在做某事。make的-ing形式是making，其他三项均不能填入此句。,"[""Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_38354,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp4.json,四年级,英语,全,"Again, please!","Again, please!",选择题,基础,0.38,2,朋友已经告诉你他正在做饭。你想进一步询问他正在制作什么食物，应选哪句话？,"[""Where are you?"", ""Can you cook?"", ""Are you cleaning your shoes?"", ""What are you cooking?""]",D,题目要求进一步询问正在制作什么食物，故选What are you cooking?。其他选项分别问位置、能力、是否正在擦鞋。,"[""Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_38355,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp4.json,四年级,英语,全,"Again, please!","Again, please!",判断题,基础,0.25,1,判断对错：有人问“Can you cook?”，回答“Sure.”可以表达“当然会”。,,对,Sure.在这个能力问答中表示“当然会”，是肯定回应，不表示正在做饭。,"[""Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_38356,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp4.json,四年级,英语,全,"Again, please!","Again, please!",选择题,基础,0.25,1,yes中的字母y发/j/。哪个选项也含有发/j/的字母y？,"[""his"", ""help"", ""bed"", ""year""]",D,year中的y与yes中的y均发/j/。his不含y；bed和help也不含y。,"[""Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_38357,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp4.json,四年级,英语,全,"Again, please!","Again, please!",选择题,基础,0.38,2,his中的字母s发/z/。下面哪个词也含有发/z/的字母s？,"[""yellow"", ""egg"", ""please"", ""your""]",C,please中的s与his中的s均发/z/。其余选项不含s，不符合题意。,"[""Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_38358,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp4.json,四年级,英语,全,"Again, please!","Again, please!",选择题,基础,0.38,2,小雨会擦自己的鞋，而且现在正在擦鞋。哪组句子完整、准确地表达了这两个信息？,"[""I can clean my shoes. I’m cleaning my shoes now."", ""I can’t clean my shoes. I’m cleaning my shoes now."", ""I can clean my shoes. I’m not cleaning my shoes now."", ""I can wash clothes. I’m washing clothes now.""]",A,题目同时要求表达会擦鞋和正在擦鞋。只有第一项同时满足；其余分别否定能力、否定当前动作或描述洗衣。,"[""Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_38359,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp5.json,四年级,英语,全,Try yourself.,Try yourself.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,"故事片段：妈妈拿着衣篮说“I’m going to wash clothes.”，随后叫“Come and help, Sue.”。谁说自己准备洗衣服？","[""Danny"", ""爸爸"", ""妈妈"", ""Sue""]",C,题干已说明拿衣篮并说这句话的是妈妈。Sue是被请求帮忙的人，不能误认成发言者。,"[""Try yourself.""]"
congcong-school_38360,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp5.json,四年级,英语,全,Try yourself.,Try yourself.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,你暂时不能马上过去，想请同伴“稍等片刻”。应选哪句话？,"[""Come and have a look."", ""Thank you."", ""Happy birthday!"", ""Wait a minute.""]",D,Wait a minute.表示稍等片刻。其他选项分别表示过来看看、谢谢和生日快乐。,"[""Try yourself.""]"
congcong-school_38361,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp5.json,四年级,英语,全,Try yourself.,Try yourself.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,爸爸说“I’m going to clean the windows. Come and help.”。根据这两句话，爸爸准备做哪件家务？,"[""洗衣服"", ""擦窗户"", ""做饭"", ""浇花""]",B,clean the windows表示擦窗户；其他三项对应洗衣、做饭和浇花，与所给句子不符。,"[""Try yourself.""]"
congcong-school_38362,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp5.json,四年级,英语,全,Try yourself.,Try yourself.,判断题,基础,0.38,2,"判断对错：孩子们说“Mum, dad, we are hungry. Can we have lunch now?”，是在说自己饿了，并询问现在能否吃午饭。",,对,hungry表示饿，Can we have lunch now?是在询问现在能否吃午饭，并不是请父母吃饭。,"[""Try yourself.""]"
congcong-school_38363,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp5.json,四年级,英语,全,Try yourself.,Try yourself.,选择题,基础,0.38,2,猜动作游戏中，卡片上的男孩实际正在清洁地板。朋友猜“He’s cooking.”。你纠正说“No. He’s _____.”，应填哪一项？,"[""cooking the meal"", ""washing clothes"", ""cleaning the floor"", ""watering the flowers""]",C,题干明确动作是清洁地板，故选cleaning the floor。其余动作均与已给信息不同。,"[""Try yourself.""]"
congcong-school_38364,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u2-kp5.json,四年级,英语,全,Try yourself.,Try yourself.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选择表示“孩子们”的英语单词。,"[""dishes"", ""children"", ""flowers"", ""windows""]",B,children表示孩子们。flowers是花，windows是窗户，dishes是盘碟。,"[""Try yourself.""]"
congcong-school_38365,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u3-exam.json,四年级,英语,全,第 3 单元挑战,Lesson 1 I want to eat noodles.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选择一个词补全“我想吃米饭”：I want ___ eat rice.,"[""some"", ""and"", ""a"", ""to""]",D,表达“想吃”用want to eat；want后不能直接接eat。其余三个词都不能构成本题句型。,"[""Lesson 1 I want to eat noodles.""]"
congcong-school_38366,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u3-exam.json,四年级,英语,全,第 3 单元挑战,Lesson 2 What would you like?,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"一位客人点餐说：“I’d like rice, chicken and tomato soup.”他选择了哪一组餐食？","[""面条、鸡肉和番茄汤"", ""米饭、鱼肉和番茄汤"", ""米饭、鸡肉和番茄汤"", ""米饭、鸡肉和梨汁""]",C,rice是米饭，chicken在点餐中表示鸡肉，tomato soup是番茄汤。其余选项分别替换了食物或汤的名称。,"[""Lesson 2 What would you like?""]"
congcong-school_38367,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u3-exam.json,四年级,英语,全,第 3 单元挑战,Lesson 3 Would you like something to drink?,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"服务员询问饮品需要。甲说“Yes. I’d like some pear juice.”乙接着说“Me, too.”乙表达了什么？","[""想请别人稍等。"", ""也想要梨汁。"", ""不想喝任何饮品。"", ""只想吃一个梨。""]",B,"Me, too.表示“我也是”。紧接在想要梨汁的回答后，表示也想要梨汁，而不是改点水果或拒绝饮品。","[""Lesson 3 Would you like something to drink?""]"
congcong-school_38368,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u3-exam.json,四年级,英语,全,第 3 单元挑战,"Lesson 4 Again, please!",判断题,基础,0.38,2,判断：nice和cold中的字母c发音相同。,,错,nice中的c发/s/，cold中的c发/k/，两者不同。,"[""Lesson 4 Again, please!""]"
congcong-school_38369,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u3-exam.json,四年级,英语,全,第 3 单元挑战,Try yourself.,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Fred说：“I’m very hungry now. I could eat a horse.”服务员回答：“Sorry. We have no horse here.”已知“I could eat a horse.”表示“我饿极了”，这段对话的幽默在哪里？,"[""没有听清客人要鸡肉。"", ""把表示非常饥饿的话按字面理解了。"", ""认为客人已经吃饱了。"", ""正在介绍餐厅里的饮品。""]",B,I could eat a horse.在这里表示“我饿极了”。服务员却回答没有马，说明他按字面理解了习语。,"[""Try yourself.""]"
congcong-school_38370,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u3-exam.json,四年级,英语,全,第 3 单元挑战,Try yourself.,选择题,基础,0.38,2,你要用鱼骨图按“水果、饮品、食物”整理本单元词汇。哪种做法符合这项学习活动的目的？,"[""只按单词的长短排列。"", ""把所有词都放进同一分支。"", ""先确定类别，再把词语放到相应分支上。"", ""只数单词数量，不关注词义。""]",C,鱼骨图按词义分类整理词汇。先确定水果、饮品、食物等类别，再归类，才有助于复习；按长度排列、全部混放或只数数量都不符合此项分类目标。,"[""Try yourself.""]"
congcong-school_38371,congcong-school,english-g4down-54-luke/lessons/english-g4down-54-luke-u3-kp1.json,四年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 I want to eat noodles.,Lesson 1 I want to eat noodles.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,你想问同伴“你想吃什么？”，应该说哪一句？,"[""What’s your name?"", ""I’m hungry."", ""What do you want to eat?"", ""Thank you.""]",C,目标是询问想吃什么，因此选含want to eat的问句。其余选项分别表示询问姓名、表达饥饿和致谢。,"[""Lesson 1 I want to eat noodles.""]"
