congcong-school_38693,congcong-school,english-g4down/lessons/english-g4down-u3-kp16.json,四年级,英语,下,Permission sentence,Permission sentence,选择题,基础,0.38,2,—Can I sit here? —______.（可以）,"[""Yes, you can."", ""No, you can't."", ""Can I?""]",A,"对 Can I...? 的肯定回答可以说“Yes, you can.”，意思是“可以”。","[""Permission sentence""]"
