congcong-school_38697,congcong-school,english-g4down/lessons/english-g4down-u3-kp2.json,四年级,英语,下,询问天气状况,询问天气状况,选择题,基础,0.25,1,想问“天气怎么样？”，应说：,"[""How are you weather?"", ""How’s the weather?"", ""What weather are?""]",B,询问天气常说“How’s the weather?”，意思是“天气怎么样？”。,"[""询问天气状况""]"
