congcong-school_38737,congcong-school,english-g4down/lessons/english-g4down-u3-kp8.json,四年级,英语,下,Response to permission,Response to permission,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Can I borrow your ruler? — ____. Here you are.,"[""Sure"", ""No, you can't"", ""Sorry"", ""Not""]",A,“Sure.”表示“当然可以”，是对请求许可的肯定回答。,"[""Response to permission""]"
