congcong-school_38855,congcong-school,english-g4down/lessons/english-g4down-u4-kp6.json,四年级,英语,下,名词复数用法,名词复数用法,选择题,基础,0.38,2,The two ________ are sleeping.,"[""babys"", ""babies"", ""babyes"", ""baby""]",B,baby 以辅音字母 b 加 y 结尾，变复数时去掉 y，加 ies，写作 babies。,"[""名词复数用法""]"
