congcong-school_38866,congcong-school,english-g4down/lessons/english-g4down-u4-kp8.json,四年级,英语,下,情态动词表建议,情态动词表建议,选择题,基础,0.25,1,You _______ eat more vegetables. They are good for you.,"[""should"", ""can"", ""am"", ""does""]",A,这句话是在给出建议，should 表示“应该”，后接动词原形 eat。,"[""情态动词表建议""]"
