congcong-school_39419,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp10.json,四年级,英语,上,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,We read pictures and stories in a ______.,"[""maths book"", ""pencil box"", ""storybook"", ""ruler""]",C,storybook 是“故事书”。故事书里通常有图画和故事，所以符合句意。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_39420,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp10.json,四年级,英语,上,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,I am hungry. I want to eat an ______.,"[""apple"", ""chair"", ""crayon"", ""clock""]",A,apple 是“苹果”，是可以吃的水果，符合句意。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_39421,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp10.json,四年级,英语,上,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,I sleep in my ______ at night.,"[""desk"", ""bed"", ""door"", ""bag""]",B,bed 是“床”。晚上睡觉通常会躺在床上。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_39422,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp10.json,四年级,英语,上,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,It is ______ today. People are carrying umbrellas.,"[""sunny"", ""rainy"", ""cold"", ""warm""]",B,rainy 意为“下雨的”。句子说人们要带雨伞，说明天气可能在下雨。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_39423,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp10.json,四年级,英语,上,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,We can borrow books from the ______.,"[""library"", ""classroom"", ""kitchen"", ""playground""]",A,library 是“图书馆”，可以在里面借书。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_39424,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp10.json,四年级,英语,上,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,The box is too ______ for this big book. The book cannot fit inside.,"[""big"", ""small"", ""long"", ""new""]",B,small 意为“小的”。句子说盒子装不下这本大书，因此盒子应该很小。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_39425,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp11.json,四年级,英语,上,不定代词,不定代词,选择题,基础,0.38,2,- Put your book ______ your head. - OK.,"[""at"", ""on"", ""under"", ""near""]",B,把书放在头上，表示“在……上面”要用介词 on。注意，on 不是不定代词。,"[""不定代词""]"
congcong-school_39426,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp11.json,四年级,英语,上,不定代词,不定代词,选择题,基础,0.25,1,I am hungry. I want to eat ______.,"[""something"", ""anything"", ""nothing"", ""everything""]",A,肯定句中表示“某样东西”，常用 something。句意：我想吃点东西。,"[""不定代词""]"
congcong-school_39427,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp11.json,四年级,英语,上,不定代词,不定代词,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Do you have ______ apples?,"[""some"", ""any"", ""every"", ""no""]",B,这是一般疑问句，询问是否有苹果，通常用 any。句意：你有苹果吗？,"[""不定代词""]"
congcong-school_39428,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp11.json,四年级,英语,上,不定代词,不定代词,选择题,基础,0.38,2,______ in our class likes the little cat.,"[""Everyone"", ""Anything"", ""Nothing"", ""Some""]",A,Everyone 表示“每个人”，常看作单数；主语为第三人称单数，因此用 likes。句意：班上的每个人都喜欢这只小猫。,"[""不定代词""]"
congcong-school_39429,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp11.json,四年级,英语,上,不定代词,不定代词,选择题,基础,0.38,2,There isn't ______ in the box.,"[""something"", ""anything"", ""everything"", ""someone""]",B,否定句中常用 anything 表示“任何东西”。句意：盒子里没有任何东西。,"[""不定代词""]"
congcong-school_39430,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp11.json,四年级,英语,上,不定代词,不定代词,填空题,基础,0.25,1,There is ______ on the desk.（桌上什么也没有。）,,nothing,Nothing 表示“没有东西”。句意：桌上什么也没有。,"[""不定代词""]"
congcong-school_39431,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp12.json,四年级,英语,上,形容词选择,形容词选择,选择题,基础,0.25,1,I have a ______ schoolbag. It's so big!,"[""new"", ""old"", ""small"", ""short""]",A,new 表示“新的”。后句说书包很大，new 与语境相符；句子表达拥有一个新书包。,"[""形容词选择""]"
congcong-school_39432,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp12.json,四年级,英语,上,形容词选择,形容词选择,选择题,基础,0.25,1,The elephant is very ______. It is much bigger than a cat.,"[""big"", ""small"", ""short"", ""young""]",A,big 表示“大”。后一句说大象很大，因此用 big 描述大象最合适。,"[""形容词选择""]"
congcong-school_39433,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp12.json,四年级,英语,上,形容词选择,形容词选择,选择题,基础,0.25,1,It's ______ today. Please put on your coat.,"[""hot"", ""cold"", ""tall"", ""new""]",B,cold 表示“冷的”。句子说天气寒冷，所以穿上外套是合理的。,"[""形容词选择""]"
