congcong-school_39435,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp12.json,四年级,英语,上,形容词选择,形容词选择,选择题,基础,0.38,2,I want to eat my lunch now. I am ______.,"[""thirsty"", ""happy"", ""hungry"", ""strong""]",C,hungry 表示“饿的”。想吃午饭说明这个人饿了。,"[""形容词选择""]"
congcong-school_39436,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp12.json,四年级,英语,上,形容词选择,形容词选择,选择题,基础,0.38,2,The snake is ______. It is longer than the ruler.,"[""short"", ""long"", ""old"", ""small""]",B,long 表示“长的”。句子说这条蛇比尺子长，因此用 long 描述蛇。,"[""形容词选择""]"
congcong-school_39437,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp13.json,四年级,英语,上,疑问词,疑问词,选择题,基础,0.38,2,-______ is your pencil box? -It's on the desk.,"[""What"", ""Where"", ""Who"", ""How""]",B,答语说明铅笔盒在桌子上，是在回答地点，因此用Where提问。,"[""疑问词""]"
congcong-school_39438,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp13.json,四年级,英语,上,疑问词,疑问词,选择题,基础,0.25,1,-______ is that girl? -She is Amy.,"[""Who"", ""Where"", ""When"", ""What""]",A,答语是一个人的姓名，说明问题询问的是人物，因此用Who。,"[""疑问词""]"
congcong-school_39439,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp13.json,四年级,英语,上,疑问词,疑问词,选择题,基础,0.25,1,-______ do you like? -I like apples.,"[""When"", ""What"", ""Who"", ""Where""]",B,答语说的是喜欢的水果，问题询问“喜欢什么”，所以用What。,"[""疑问词""]"
congcong-school_39440,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp13.json,四年级,英语,上,疑问词,疑问词,选择题,基础,0.38,2,-______ do you get up? -At seven.,"[""How"", ""Who"", ""When"", ""Where""]",C,答语中的“at seven”表示时间，因此用When询问什么时候。,"[""疑问词""]"
