congcong-school_39442,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp13.json,四年级,英语,上,疑问词,疑问词,选择题,基础,0.38,2,-______ do you go to school? -By bus.,"[""Where"", ""Who"", ""How"", ""When""]",C,答语说明去学校的方式是乘公共汽车，询问方式用How。,"[""疑问词""]"
