congcong-school_39539,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp8.json,四年级,英语,上,方位介词,方位介词,判断题,基础,0.38,2,'under the desk' 表示在课桌里面。,,错,under 表示“在……下面”；“在课桌里面”应说 in the desk。,"[""方位介词""]"
congcong-school_39540,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u2-kp8.json,四年级,英语,上,方位介词,方位介词,选择题,基础,0.25,1,“球在椅子上。”用英语怎么说？,"[""A. The ball is in the chair."", ""B. The ball is on the chair."", ""C. The ball is under the chair.""]",B,on 表示“在……上面”，所以“球在椅子上”是 The ball is on the chair.,"[""方位介词""]"
