congcong-school_40065,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u6-kp7.json,四年级,英语,上,语法搭配,语法搭配,选择题,基础,0.38,2,How many books ______ Tom have?,"[""do"", ""does"", ""is"", ""are""]",B,主语 Tom 是第三人称单数，所以用 does；does 后面的动词用原形 have。,"[""语法搭配""]"
congcong-school_40066,congcong-school,english-g4up/lessons/english-g4up-u6-kp7.json,四年级,英语,上,语法搭配,语法搭配,填空题,基础,0.38,2,填入合适的词组：________ milk do you want?,,How much,Milk 是不可数名词，询问它的数量用 How much。,"[""语法搭配""]"
