congcong-school_40123,congcong-school,english-g5down-54-luke/lessons/english-g5down-54-luke-u2-kp1.json,五年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 Let's stop and wait.,Lesson 1 Let's stop and wait.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,你想对同伴说“咱们在这里等吧”。选择语法正确的句子。,"[""Let's wait here."", ""Let's to wait here."", ""Let's waits here."", ""Let's waiting here.""]",A,Let's后接动词原形wait；waits、waiting和to wait都不能直接用于这里的句型。,"[""Lesson 1 Let's stop and wait.""]"
congcong-school_40124,congcong-school,english-g5down-54-luke/lessons/english-g5down-54-luke-u2-kp1.json,五年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 Let's stop and wait.,Lesson 1 Let's stop and wait.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,排队时有人推你。选择语法正确、表示“请不要推我”的提醒。,"[""Don't pushes me, please."", ""Not push me, please."", ""Don't push me, please."", ""Don't pushing me, please.""]",C,Don't后接动词原形push，please使提醒更礼貌；其他三项均不符合该祈使句结构。,"[""Lesson 1 Let's stop and wait.""]"
