congcong-school_40126,congcong-school,english-g5down-54-luke/lessons/english-g5down-54-luke-u2-kp1.json,五年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 Let's stop and wait.,Lesson 1 Let's stop and wait.,选择题,基础,0.38,2,下面哪一句使用本课所学句型，表示“建议大家一起停在这里”？,"[""Let's stop here."", ""Don't stop here."", ""I stop here."", ""They stop here.""]",A,Let's stop here.是一起停在这里的建议；Don't stop here.是否定提醒，另外两项是陈述句。,"[""Lesson 1 Let's stop and wait.""]"
