congcong-school_40129,congcong-school,english-g5down-54-luke/lessons/english-g5down-54-luke-u2-kp2.json,五年级,英语,全,"Lesson 2 Don't shout, please.","Lesson 2 Don't shout, please.",选择题,基础,0.25,1,"你要提醒车上大声喊叫的人。选择正确形式填空：Don't ______, please.","[""to shout"", ""shouts"", ""shouting"", ""shout""]",D,Don't后接动词原形shout，表示不要大声喊叫；shouts、shouting和to shout均不符合这里的结构。,"[""Lesson 2 Don't shout, please.""]"
