congcong-school_40131,congcong-school,english-g5down-54-luke/lessons/english-g5down-54-luke-u2-kp2.json,五年级,英语,全,"Lesson 2 Don't shout, please.","Lesson 2 Don't shout, please.",选择题,基础,0.25,1,你给乘客让座，乘客说“Thank you.”。你想表达“不客气”，应选哪一句？,"[""Don't run."", ""I'm sorry."", ""You're welcome."", ""Hurry up.""]",C,You're welcome.用于回应感谢；I'm sorry.是道歉，Hurry up.是催促，Don't run.是提醒不要跑。,"[""Lesson 2 Don't shout, please.""]"
