congcong-school_40138,congcong-school,english-g5down-54-luke/lessons/english-g5down-54-luke-u2-kp3.json,五年级,英语,全,Lesson 3 They are in the zoo.,Lesson 3 They are in the zoo.,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选择表示动物“鹿”的单词。,"[""near"", ""grass"", ""dear"", ""deer""]",D,deer表示鹿；dear在亲昵称呼中表示亲爱的，near表示近，grass表示草。,"[""Lesson 3 They are in the zoo.""]"
