congcong-school_40860,congcong-school,english-g5down/lessons/english-g5down-u6-kp8.json,五年级,英语,下,现在进行时一般疑问句,现在进行时一般疑问句,填空题,基础,0.38,2,用run的正确形式完成句子：______ the boys ______ in the playground?,,Are the boys running?,the boys是复数主语，使用Are；一般疑问句中Are放在主语前，run变为running。,"[""现在进行时一般疑问句""]"
congcong-school_40861,congcong-school,english-g5down/lessons/english-g5down-u6-kp8.json,五年级,英语,下,现在进行时一般疑问句,现在进行时一般疑问句,选择题,基础,0.38,2,— Is Tom sleeping now? — ________（否定回答）,"[""No, he isn't."", ""No, he aren't."", ""No, he doesn't."", ""Yes, he isn't.""]",A,"问句中的主语是he，be动词是is。否定简短回答为“No, he is not.”，常缩写为“No, he isn't.”","[""现在进行时一般疑问句""]"
congcong-school_40862,congcong-school,english-g5down/lessons/english-g5down-u6-kp9.json,五年级,英语,下,现在进行时,现在进行时,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Look! The panda is ________ bamboo.,"[""eat"", ""eats"", ""eating"", ""ate""]",C,Look!提示动作正在发生。现在进行时结构为be动词+动词-ing，panda是单数，所以用is eating。,"[""现在进行时""]"
congcong-school_40863,congcong-school,english-g5down/lessons/english-g5down-u6-kp9.json,五年级,英语,下,现在进行时,现在进行时,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选出正确的句子。,"[""They are playing football now."", ""They is playing football now."", ""They playing football now."", ""They are play football now.""]",A,句中的 now 表示动作正在进行。主语 They 是复数，be 动词用 are；play 加 -ing 变为 playing。,"[""现在进行时""]"
congcong-school_40864,congcong-school,english-g5down/lessons/english-g5down-u6-kp9.json,五年级,英语,下,现在进行时,现在进行时,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Listen! My sister ________ a book.,"[""My sister read a book."", ""My sister is reading a book."", ""My sister are reading a book."", ""My sister is read a book.""]",B,Listen! 提示动作正在发生。My sister 是单数，be 动词用 is；read 加 -ing 变为 reading。,"[""现在进行时""]"
congcong-school_40865,congcong-school,english-g5down/lessons/english-g5down-u6-kp9.json,五年级,英语,下,现在进行时,现在进行时,判断题,基础,0.25,1,“Tom is doing his homework.”变成一般疑问句是“Is Tom doing his homework?”,,False,现在进行时的一般疑问句要将be动词提到主语前，应为“Is Tom doing his homework?”,"[""现在进行时""]"
