congcong-school_41094,congcong-school,english-g5up-54-luke/lessons/english-g5up-54-luke-u7-kp1.json,五年级,英语,全,Lesson 1 We visit our relatives and friends.,Lesson 1 We visit our relatives and friends.,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"阅读：“Before the Spring Festival, Lin’s family buy flowers. On the first day, they wear new clothes.” 根据这些信息，Lin一家买什么？","[""They buy food."", ""They buy flowers."", ""They buy new clothes."", ""They buy books.""]",B,第一句明确说一家人买花；第二句说穿新衣，并没有说买新衣。其他选项的购买对象也未出现。,"[""Lesson 1 We visit our relatives and friends.""]"
