congcong-school_41784,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 1 单元挑战,比较级句型,选择题,基础,0.25,1,She is 2 years ____ than me.,"[""old"", ""older"", ""young"", ""oldder""]",B,than引导比较句，使用比较级older।,"[""比较级句型""]"
