congcong-school_41786,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 1 单元挑战,介词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Look! The sun is shining ____ the window.,"[""at"", ""through"", ""on"", ""in""]",B,through the window 穿过窗户。,"[""介词辨析""]"
congcong-school_41787,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 1 单元挑战,比较级特殊形式,选择题,中等,0.55,3,Which of these words is NOT a comparative form?,"[""smaller"", ""stronger"", ""father"", ""shorter""]",C,father是名词“父亲”，虽然以er结尾但不是形容词比较级。,"[""比较级特殊形式""]"
congcong-school_41788,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 1 单元挑战,比较级拼写,填空题,基础,0.38,2,The whale is ___ than the dolphin. (heavy),,heavier,heavy变比较级为heavier。,"[""比较级拼写""]"
congcong-school_41789,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 1 单元挑战,单位表达,填空题,中等,0.55,3,I am 1.65 ___ tall.,,metres,描述身高单位为米，复数形式为metres。,"[""单位表达""]"
congcong-school_41790,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 1 单元挑战,询问信息,填空题,基础,0.38,2,___ size are your shoes?,,what,疑问短语What size。,"[""询问信息""]"
congcong-school_41791,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 1 单元挑战,对比词汇,连线题,基础,0.25,1,将下列原形与其比较级对应。,,"A-3,B-4,C-1,D-2",考察形容词原形与比较级的对应。,"[""对比词汇""]"
congcong-school_41792,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词比较级的规则构成,形容词比较级的规则构成,填空题,基础,0.25,1,把 tall 变成比较级：tall → ____。,,taller,tall 是一般以字母组合结尾的短形容词，比较级通常加 er：tall → taller。,"[""形容词比较级的规则构成""]"
congcong-school_41793,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词比较级的规则构成,形容词比较级的规则构成,填空题,基础,0.25,1,把 large 变成比较级：large → ____。,,larger,large 以不发音的 e 结尾，只需加 r：large → larger。,"[""形容词比较级的规则构成""]"
congcong-school_41794,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词比较级的规则构成,形容词比较级的规则构成,选择题,基础,0.38,2,选择形容词 happy 的正确比较级。,"[""happier"", ""happyer"", ""more happy"", ""happiest""]",A,happy 以“辅音字母+y”结尾，变比较级时先把 y 改成 i，再加 er，写作 happier。,"[""形容词比较级的规则构成""]"
congcong-school_41795,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词比较级的规则构成,形容词比较级的规则构成,填空题,基础,0.38,2,把 hot 变成比较级：hot → ____。,,hotter,hot 是重读闭音节词，末尾符合“辅音-元音-辅音”结构，需双写末尾的 t 再加 er：hot → hotter。,"[""形容词比较级的规则构成""]"
congcong-school_41796,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词比较级的规则构成,形容词比较级的规则构成,填空题,基础,0.38,2,beautiful 的比较级是 ____。,,more beautiful,beautiful 是较长的形容词，通常在原形前加 more 构成比较级。,"[""形容词比较级的规则构成""]"
congcong-school_41797,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词比较级的规则构成,形容词比较级的规则构成,填空题,基础,0.25,1,This book is thicker ____ that one.（比那本书厚）,,than,比较两个人或事物时，常用“比较级 + than”表示“比……更……”。,"[""形容词比较级的规则构成""]"
congcong-school_41798,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,比较级构成规则,比较级构成规则,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Which word is the comparative form（比较级）of 'big'?,"[""biggier"", ""biger"", ""bigger"", ""big""]",C,big 是重读闭音节单词，末尾是“辅音字母 + 元音字母 + 辅音字母”，构成比较级时要双写词尾字母 g，再加 -er。,"[""比较级构成规则""]"
congcong-school_41799,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,比较级构成规则,比较级构成规则,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Which is the comparative form of 'happy'?,"[""happyer"", ""happier"", ""more happy"", ""happiest""]",B,happy 以“辅音字母 + y”结尾，构成比较级时把 y 改成 i，再加 -er。,"[""比较级构成规则""]"
congcong-school_41800,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,比较级构成规则,比较级构成规则,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Choose the correct comparative form of 'nice'.,"[""niceer"", ""nicer"", ""nicier"", ""more nice""]",B,nice 以字母 e 结尾，构成比较级时只加 -r。,"[""比较级构成规则""]"
congcong-school_41801,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,比较级构成规则,比较级构成规则,填空题,基础,0.25,1,Fill in the blank: Tom is ____ than Jack. (tall),,taller,tall 是一般的单音节形容词，通常直接在词尾加 -er，变成 taller。,"[""比较级构成规则""]"
congcong-school_41802,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,比较级构成规则,比较级构成规则,填空题,基础,0.38,2,Fill in the blank: This flower is ____ than that one. (beautiful),,more beautiful,beautiful 是较长的形容词，通常在它前面加 more 构成比较级：more beautiful。,"[""比较级构成规则""]"
congcong-school_41803,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,比较级构成规则,比较级构成规则,填空题,基础,0.38,2,Complete the sentence with the comparative form of 'big': My schoolbag is ____ than yours.,,bigger,big 是重读闭音节单词，比较级要双写词尾辅音字母 g，再加 -er，因此是 bigger。,"[""比较级构成规则""]"
congcong-school_41804,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词辨析,形容词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Your feet are bigger than mine. You wear size ____.,"[""37"", ""40"", ""small"", ""kg""]",B,句子说你的脚比我的大，因此穿的尺码应更大。37和40中，40是较大的尺码；small是形容词，kg是重量单位。,"[""形容词辨析""]"
congcong-school_41805,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词辨析,形容词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"Tom is ____ than his brother. He is 150 cm tall, and his brother is 145 cm tall.","[""tall"", ""taller"", ""tallest"", ""short""]",B,句中有 than，表示比较；描述身高时用 tall 的比较级 taller。,"[""形容词辨析""]"
congcong-school_41806,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词辨析,形容词辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,This box is difficult to carry. It is very ____.,"[""heavy"", ""long"", ""young"", ""happy""]",A,句意是“这个箱子很重”，描述箱子的重量用形容词 heavy。,"[""形容词辨析""]"
congcong-school_41807,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词辨析,形容词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"My sister is ____ than me. She is twelve, and I am ten.","[""old"", ""older"", ""oldest"", ""young""]",B,than 提示进行比较；描述年龄时用 old 的比较级 older。,"[""形容词辨析""]"
congcong-school_41808,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词辨析,形容词辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Put on your coat. It is ____ outside today.,"[""cold"", ""hot"", ""short"", ""strong""]",A,句意是“天气冷”，描述天气温度用 cold；hot 表示热，不能与句意匹配。,"[""形容词辨析""]"
congcong-school_41809,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词辨析,形容词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,I feel ____ today than I did yesterday.,"[""good"", ""better"", ""best"", ""well""]",B,句中有 than，表示比较。good 的比较级是不规则变化 better，句意是“今天感觉比昨天好”。,"[""形容词辨析""]"
congcong-school_41810,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,询问体重,询问体重,选择题,基础,0.38,2,How ____ is the dinosaur? — It is 5 tons.,"[""tall"", ""heavy"", ""big"", ""strong""]",B,回答用了tons（吨），表示重量，因此用How heavy询问；How tall询问身高，How strong询问力量。,"[""询问体重""]"
congcong-school_41811,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,询问体重,询问体重,填空题,基础,0.25,1,How ____ is your brother?,,heavy,询问一个人的体重用“How heavy is...?”，意为“……有多重？”。,"[""询问体重""]"
congcong-school_41812,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,询问体重,询问体重,填空题,基础,0.38,2,把下列词语连成句子：heavy / is / the box / How,,How heavy is the box?,询问单数物品的重量用“How heavy is + 单数主语?”。,"[""询问体重""]"
congcong-school_41813,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,询问体重,询问体重,选择题,基础,0.38,2,How heavy ____ these people?,"[""is"", ""are"", ""am"", ""be""]",B,people是复数名词，be动词用are，所以句子是“How heavy are these people?”。,"[""询问体重""]"
congcong-school_41814,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,询问体重,询问体重,填空题,基础,0.38,2,回答：How heavy is the watermelon?（8 kilograms）,,It is 8 kilograms.,回答单数物品的重量时，用“It is + 数字 + 重量单位.”。,"[""询问体重""]"
congcong-school_41815,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,询问体重,询问体重,选择题,中等,0.55,3,选出询问“这些大象有多重？”的正确句子。,"[""How heavy are the elephants?"", ""How tall are the elephants?"", ""How much heavy are the elephants?"", ""How heavy is the elephants?""]",A,elephants是复数，因此用are；询问重量的固定表达是How heavy。,"[""询问体重""]"
congcong-school_41816,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,句型识别,句型识别,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选出翻译正确的一项：那只恐龙比我高。,"[""That dinosaur is tall than me."", ""That dinosaur is taller than me."", ""That dinosaur is shorter than me."", ""I am taller than that dinosaur.""]",B,taller 是 tall 的比较级，taller than 表示“比……高”。其他选项的比较方向或语法不符合原句。,"[""句型识别""]"
congcong-school_41817,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,句型识别,句型识别,选择题,基础,0.25,1,“The elephant is bigger than the dog.”属于哪种句型？,"[""A. 一般疑问句"", ""B. 比较级陈述句"", ""C. 特殊疑问句"", ""D. 祈使句""]",B,句子中有“taller than”，表示把恐龙和我进行比较，因此是比较级陈述句。,"[""句型识别""]"
congcong-school_41818,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,句型识别,句型识别,填空题,基础,0.38,2,用 Where、does、your sister、live 组成一个询问“你姐姐住在哪里？”的特殊疑问句。,,Where does your sister live?,询问地点用 Where；特殊疑问句结构为“疑问词 + 助动词 + 主语 + 动词原形”。主语 your sister 是第三人称单数，所以用 does，后面的 live 用原形。,"[""句型识别""]"
congcong-school_41819,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,句型识别,句型识别,判断题,基础,0.25,1,判断正误：“Are you hungry?”是一般疑问句。,,正确,“Are + 主语 + 其他？”是以 Be 动词开头的一般疑问句，通常用 Yes 或 No 回答。,"[""句型识别""]"
congcong-school_41820,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,句型识别,句型识别,填空题,基础,0.38,2,填空：My brother is ______ (tall) than me.,,taller,句中有 than，表示比较两者。tall 的比较级是 taller，因此应填 taller。,"[""句型识别""]"
congcong-school_41821,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,句型识别,句型识别,填空题,基础,0.38,2,将下列词语连成句子：many / books / do / you / have / how。,,How many books do you have?,询问可数物品的数量用 How many。一般现在时中，主语 you 对应助动词 do，句式为“How many + 可数名词复数 + do + 主语 + 动词原形？”,"[""句型识别""]"
congcong-school_41822,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,固定搭配,固定搭配,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Please ____ it into the hall.,"[""get"", ""take"", ""bring"", ""put""]",B,take ... into 表示“把……带进……”。本句意思是“请把它带进大厅”。,"[""固定搭配""]"
congcong-school_41823,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,固定搭配,固定搭配,填空题,基础,0.25,1,I like to ____ music after school.,,listen to,listen 后面接表示听的对象时，通常要用 to。listen to music 表示“听音乐”。,"[""固定搭配""]"
congcong-school_41824,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,固定搭配,固定搭配,选择题,基础,0.38,2,I can't find my pencil. I am ____ it.,"[""look at"", ""look for"", ""look after"", ""look like""]",B,look for 表示“寻找”。句意是“我正在寻找我的铅笔”。,"[""固定搭配""]"
congcong-school_41825,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,固定搭配,固定搭配,判断题,基础,0.25,1,“She is good at singing.”中的 be good at 表示“擅长”。,,True,be good at 是固定搭配，表示“擅长……”，后面可以接名词或动词-ing形式。,"[""固定搭配""]"
congcong-school_41826,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,固定搭配,固定搭配,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Can you ____ the little cat while I am away?,"[""look after"", ""look for"", ""look at"", ""look up""]",A,look after 表示“照顾”。句意是“你能照顾这只小猫吗？”,"[""固定搭配""]"
congcong-school_41827,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,固定搭配,固定搭配,填空题,基础,0.25,1,Please say hello ____ your teacher.,,to,say to somebody 是常见搭配，表示“对某人说”。完整句子为：Please say hello to your teacher.（请向你的老师问好。）,"[""固定搭配""]"
congcong-school_41828,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp15.json,六年级,英语,下,逻辑理解,逻辑理解,选择题,基础,0.38,2,A is 1.6m. B is 1.55m. So A is ____ than B.,"[""shorter"", ""taller"", ""smaller"", ""thin""]",B,1.6米比1.55米高，因此A比B高，填比较级 taller。,"[""逻辑理解""]"
congcong-school_41829,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u1-kp15.json,六年级,英语,下,逻辑理解,逻辑理解,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Tom stayed at home ____ it was raining.,"[""because"", ""but"", ""or"", ""so""]",A,后半句说明他没去公园的原因，因此用 because 表示“因为”。,"[""逻辑理解""]"
