congcong-school_41970,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u2-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,疑问句回答,疑问句回答,选择题,基础,0.25,1,—Does Amy like apples? —________.,"[""No, she don't."", ""No, she doesn't."", ""No, she isn't."", ""No, she didn't.""]",B,"Does 引导的一般疑问句用 does 回答。主语是 she，否定简答为 No, she doesn't。","[""疑问句回答""]"
congcong-school_41971,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u2-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,疑问句回答,疑问句回答,选择题,基础,0.25,1,—Are your friends in the classroom? —________.,"[""Yes, they do."", ""Yes, they are."", ""Yes, they is."", ""Yes, they did.""]",B,"Are 引导的问句用 are 回答；主语 they 对应 are，因此肯定回答是 Yes, they are。","[""疑问句回答""]"
