congcong-school_42035,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u2-kp24.json,六年级,英语,下,动词原形与过去式对应,动词原形与过去式对应,填空题,基础,0.25,1,请将单词原形与其过去式对应。A. wash　B. study　C. do　D. go；1. washed　2. went　3. studied　4. did,,"A-4,B-3,C-1,D-2",对应规则：wash-washed，study-studied，do-did，go-went。,"[""动词原形与过去式对应""]"
