congcong-school_42263,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,There be 句型的时态对比,There be 句型的时态对比,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选择合适的词填空：_____ a book on the desk now.,"[""There is"", ""There are"", ""There was"", ""There were""]",A,句子中的 now 表示现在；a book 是单数，所以用 There is。,"[""There be 句型的时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42264,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,There be 句型的时态对比,There be 句型的时态对比,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选择合适的词填空：_____ three birds in the tree last Sunday.,"[""There is"", ""There are"", ""There was"", ""There were""]",D,last Sunday 表示过去；three birds 是复数，所以用 There were。,"[""There be 句型的时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42265,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,There be 句型的时态对比,There be 句型的时态对比,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选择合适的词填空：_____ some water in the bottle yesterday.,"[""There is"", ""There are"", ""There was"", ""There were""]",C,yesterday 表示过去；water 是不可数名词，按单数看待，因此用 There was。,"[""There be 句型的时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42266,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,There be 句型的时态对比,There be 句型的时态对比,判断题,基础,0.25,1,判断正误：There were two apples in the bag yesterday.,,True,two apples 是复数，yesterday 表示过去，因此 There were two apples... 正确。,"[""There be 句型的时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42267,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,There be 句型的时态对比,There be 句型的时态对比,填空题,基础,0.38,2,填空：_____ many children in the park every day.,,There are,every day 表示经常发生的情况，用一般现在时；many children 是复数，所以用 There are。,"[""There be 句型的时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42268,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp1.json,六年级,英语,下,There be 句型的时态对比,There be 句型的时态对比,填空题,基础,0.38,2,用 There be 句型翻译：十年前，我学校附近有一家小商店。,,There was a small shop near my school ten years ago.,ten years ago 表示过去；a small shop 是单数，所以用 There was。改写时保留地点和时间信息。,"[""There be 句型的时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42269,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,个人爱好对比,个人爱好对比,选择题,基础,0.25,1,I didn't _____ like eggs before.,"[""liked"", ""like"", ""likes"", ""liking""]",B,didn't 后面接动词原形，所以用 like。,"[""个人爱好对比""]"
congcong-school_42270,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,个人爱好对比,个人爱好对比,选择题,基础,0.25,1,"Amy _____ playing badminton now, but she didn't like it before.","[""like"", ""likes"", ""liked"", ""liking""]",B,句子描述现在的喜好，主语是第三人称单数 Amy，所以 like 要加 -s。,"[""个人爱好对比""]"
congcong-school_42271,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,个人爱好对比,个人爱好对比,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"Tom _____ like drawing, but now he draws every day.","[""doesn't used to"", ""didn't use to"", ""didn't used to"", ""don't use to""]",B,didn't 后接动词原形。didn't use to 表示过去没有某种习惯或喜好。,"[""个人爱好对比""]"
congcong-school_42272,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,个人爱好对比,个人爱好对比,填空题,基础,0.25,1,"I like _____ (swim) now, but I didn't like it before.",,swimming,like 后面可以接动词-ing形式，因此填 swimming。,"[""个人爱好对比""]"
congcong-school_42273,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,个人爱好对比,个人爱好对比,填空题,基础,0.25,1,"I didn't like milk before, _____ I like it now.",,but,前后两部分表示过去和现在的不同，用 but（但是）连接。,"[""个人爱好对比""]"
congcong-school_42274,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp10.json,六年级,英语,下,个人爱好对比,个人爱好对比,填空题,基础,0.38,2,根据提示写句子：she / like reading now / but / not like it before,,"She likes reading now, but she didn't like it before.",She 是第三人称单数，描述现在的喜好时用 likes；描述过去的否定喜好时用 didn't like，didn't 后用动词原形。,"[""个人爱好对比""]"
congcong-school_42275,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,"My school was small ten years ago, but now it is ______.","[""old"", ""quiet"", ""small"", ""large""]",D,but 表示转折，前面说学校过去很小，后面应表示现在变大了，因此选 large。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_42276,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,"It is cold in winter, but it is ______ in summer.","[""warm"", ""hot"", ""cool"", ""wet""]",B,句意是“夏天很热，但冬天很冷”。cold 和 hot 意思相反，符合 but 表示的转折关系。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_42277,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Lily heard the good news and felt very ______.,"[""sad"", ""happy"", ""tired"", ""hungry""]",B,句意是“听到好消息后，莉莉很高兴”。happy 表示“高兴的”，符合语境。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_42278,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,May I ______ a book from you?,"[""buy"", ""borrow"", ""lend"", ""bring""]",B,句意是“我可以从你那里借一本书吗？”borrow 表示“向别人借入”，符合 from you 的语境；lend 表示“借出”。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_42279,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"The rabbit runs ______, but the turtle runs slowly.","[""fast"", ""slow"", ""high"", ""long""]",A,句意是“兔子跑得快，乌龟跑得慢”。slow 表示“慢的”，fast 表示“快的”，前后形成对比。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_42280,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp11.json,六年级,英语,下,词义辨析,词义辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Please keep our classroom ______. Don't throw rubbish on the floor.,"[""dirty"", ""clean"", ""busy"", ""strong""]",B,句意是“请保持教室干净，不要把垃圾扔在地上”。clean 表示“干净的”，与不要乱扔垃圾的要求相符。,"[""词义辨析""]"
congcong-school_42281,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,特殊疑问句,特殊疑问句,选择题,基础,0.25,1,How ______ did you change?,"[""many"", ""much"", ""old"", ""often""]",B,How much 可询问程度或变化的量，句意为“你改变了多少？”。,"[""特殊疑问句""]"
congcong-school_42282,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,特殊疑问句,特殊疑问句,选择题,基础,0.25,1,______ did you play football yesterday? — In the park.,"[""When"", ""Where"", ""Who"", ""Why""]",B,询问地点用 Where。一般过去时的特殊疑问句语序为疑问词 + did + 主语 + 动词原形。,"[""特殊疑问句""]"
congcong-school_42283,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,特殊疑问句,特殊疑问句,选择题,基础,0.25,1,______ do you get up? — At seven o'clock.,"[""What"", ""When"", ""Where"", ""Who""]",B,询问时间用 When。回答“在七点钟”说明问的是几点做某事。,"[""特殊疑问句""]"
congcong-school_42284,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,特殊疑问句,特殊疑问句,选择题,基础,0.38,2,______ are you happy? — Because I got a present.,"[""Who"", ""Why"", ""When"", ""Where""]",B,询问原因用 Why，常用 because 引导的句子回答。,"[""特殊疑问句""]"
congcong-school_42285,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,特殊疑问句,特殊疑问句,选择题,基础,0.38,2,______ apples are there in the basket?,"[""How much"", ""How many"", ""How old"", ""How often""]",B,询问可数名词的数量用 How many，后接可数名词复数 apples。,"[""特殊疑问句""]"
congcong-school_42286,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp12.json,六年级,英语,下,特殊疑问句,特殊疑问句,选择题,基础,0.38,2,______ opened the window?,"[""Who"", ""What"", ""Where"", ""When""]",A,句中 Who 是主语，询问“谁做了这件事”，因此直接接谓语动词，不需要再用 did。,"[""特殊疑问句""]"
congcong-school_42287,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,助动词辨析,助动词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,What ______ you do last night?,"[""do"", ""did"", ""does"", ""done""]",B,last night表示过去，疑问句借用助动词did。did后面的实义动词用原形do。,"[""助动词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42288,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,助动词辨析,助动词辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,______ Tom like apples?,"[""do"", ""does"", ""did"", ""is""]",B,主语Tom是第三人称单数，句子表示一般现在时，因此用does；does后面的动词用原形like。,"[""助动词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42289,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,助动词辨析,助动词辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,I ______ play computer games on school nights.,"[""don't"", ""doesn't"", ""didn't"", ""isn't""]",A,主语I在一般现在时的否定句中使用don't，后面的动词用原形play。,"[""助动词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42290,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,助动词辨析,助动词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,______ your parents visit the museum yesterday?,"[""Do"", ""Does"", ""Did"", ""Are""]",C,yesterday表示过去，疑问句用Did开头，主语后面的实义动词用原形visit。,"[""助动词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42291,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,助动词辨析,助动词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,She ______ watch TV before finishing her homework.,"[""don't"", ""doesn't"", ""didn't"", ""wasn't""]",B,主语She是第三人称单数，一般现在时否定句用doesn't；doesn't后面接动词原形watch。,"[""助动词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42292,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp13.json,六年级,英语,下,助动词辨析,助动词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,We ______ go to the park last Sunday because it rained.,"[""don't"", ""doesn't"", ""didn't"", ""isn't""]",C,last Sunday表示过去，否定句使用didn't；didn't后面的实义动词用原形go。,"[""助动词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42293,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,时态对比,时态对比,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Now I ______ active in class.,"[""was"", ""be"", ""is"", ""am""]",D,Now表示现在；主语I与be动词am搭配。,"[""时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42294,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,时态对比,时态对比,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Tom ______ basketball every day.,"[""play"", ""plays"", ""played"", ""playing""]",B,every day表示经常发生的动作，用一般现在时；主语Tom是第三人称单数，play要加-s。,"[""时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42295,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,时态对比,时态对比,选择题,基础,0.25,1,We ______ to the zoo yesterday.,"[""go"", ""goes"", ""went"", ""going""]",C,yesterday表示过去，句子用一般过去时；go的过去式是不规则变化went。,"[""时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42296,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,时态对比,时态对比,选择题,基础,0.38,2,They ______ at home last Sunday.,"[""are"", ""was"", ""were"", ""is""]",C,last Sunday表示过去；主语They是复数，be动词过去式用were。,"[""时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42297,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,时态对比,时态对比,选择题,基础,0.38,2,She ______ a big dinner last night.,"[""has"", ""have"", ""had"", ""having""]",C,last night表示过去，句子用一般过去时；have的过去式是had。,"[""时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42298,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp14.json,六年级,英语,下,时态对比,时态对比,选择题,基础,0.38,2,My brother usually ______ like carrots.,"[""don't"", ""doesn't"", ""didn't"", ""isn't""]",B,usually表示通常发生的事情，用一般现在时；主语My brother是第三人称单数，否定句用doesn't，后面的动词保持原形like。,"[""时态对比""]"
congcong-school_42299,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp15.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词等级,形容词等级,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Who is the ______ girl in your class?,"[""tallest"", ""taller"", ""tall"", ""talling""]",A,句中比较范围是班级里的所有女生，属于三者或三者以上的比较，用最高级 tallest；最高级前通常加 the。,"[""形容词等级""]"
congcong-school_42300,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp15.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词等级,形容词等级,选择题,基础,0.25,1,My dog is ______ than your dog.,"[""big"", ""bigger"", ""biggest"", ""more big""]",B,句中比较两只狗，且有 than 提示，应用比较级。big 是重读闭音节短形容词，双写末尾字母 g 再加 -er，变为 bigger。,"[""形容词等级""]"
congcong-school_42301,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp15.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词等级,形容词等级,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Tom is ______ of the three boys.,"[""tall"", ""taller"", ""the tallest"", ""the taller""]",C,三名学生进行比较，应用最高级。tall 的最高级是 tallest，最高级前加 the。,"[""形容词等级""]"
congcong-school_42302,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp15.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词等级,形容词等级,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Lily looks ______ today than yesterday.,"[""happy"", ""happier"", ""happiest"", ""more happy""]",B,句意是“今天比昨天更开心”，是在两者之间比较，要用比较级。happy 以辅音字母加 y 结尾，变 y 为 i 再加 -er，写作 happier。,"[""形容词等级""]"
congcong-school_42303,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp15.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词等级,形容词等级,选择题,基础,0.38,2,This book is ______ than that one.,"[""good"", ""better"", ""best"", ""well""]",B,good 的比较级是不规则变化 better。句中有 than，表示两本书之间的比较。,"[""形容词等级""]"
congcong-school_42304,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp15.json,六年级,英语,下,形容词等级,形容词等级,选择题,基础,0.38,2,I am ______ my sister. We are both 150 cm tall.,"[""as tall as"", ""taller than"", ""the tallest"", ""more tall than""]",A,句意是“和姐姐一样高”，使用原级比较结构 as + 形容词原形 + as，因此填 as tall as。,"[""形容词等级""]"
congcong-school_42305,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp16.json,六年级,英语,下,语境理解,语境理解,选择题,中等,0.55,3,"Before, I was short. Now, I am ______.","[""thin"", ""tall"", ""quiet"", ""short""]",B,Before 和 Now 表示前后变化；short（矮的）与 tall（高的）相对，因此现在应是 tall。,"[""语境理解""]"
congcong-school_42306,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp16.json,六年级,英语,下,语境理解,语境理解,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"It is lunchtime, and I haven't eaten anything today. I am ______.","[""hungry"", ""sleepy"", ""thirsty"", ""happy""]",A,句子说午饭时间还没吃东西，因此感到饿（hungry）最符合语境。,"[""语境理解""]"
congcong-school_42307,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp16.json,六年级,英语,下,语境理解,语境理解,选择题,基础,0.38,2,It is raining outside. Take your ______ before you leave.,"[""sunglasses"", ""umbrella"", ""basketball"", ""storybook""]",B,天在下雨，出门时带伞可以挡雨，因此应选 umbrella。,"[""语境理解""]"
congcong-school_42308,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp16.json,六年级,英语,下,语境理解,语境理解,选择题,中等,0.55,3,"______ I missed the bus, I was late for school.","[""But"", ""Because"", ""Or"", ""So""]",B,后半句说明了迟到的原因，所以用 Because（因为）连接原因和结果。,"[""语境理解""]"
congcong-school_42309,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp16.json,六年级,英语,下,语境理解,语境理解,选择题,中等,0.55,3,I put on my coat because I felt ______.,"[""hot"", ""cold"", ""hungry"", ""busy""]",B,后句说穿上了外套，说明当时觉得冷，因此空格填 cold。,"[""语境理解""]"
congcong-school_42310,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp16.json,六年级,英语,下,语境理解,语境理解,选择题,中等,0.55,3,"I like football, ______ I can't play it well.","[""and"", ""because"", ""but"", ""so""]",C,句意是“我喜欢足球，但我不会踢”，前后内容形成转折，因此用 but。,"[""语境理解""]"
congcong-school_42311,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp17.json,六年级,英语,下,名词辨析,名词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,People can see many stars in the ______ at night.,"[""gym"", ""dining hall"", ""sky"", ""grass""]",C,星星通常出现在天空中，sky意为“天空”。,"[""名词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42312,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp17.json,六年级,英语,下,名词辨析,名词辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,We can borrow books from the ______.,"[""library"", ""kitchen"", ""farm"", ""playground""]",A,在图书馆，人们可以借书或读书；library意为“图书馆”。,"[""名词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42313,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp17.json,六年级,英语,下,名词辨析,名词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Brush your ______ twice a day to keep them clean.,"[""tooth"", ""teeth"", ""tooths"", ""toothes""]",B,tooth意为“牙齿”，其复数形式是不规则变化teeth。many后接可数名词复数。,"[""名词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42314,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp17.json,六年级,英语,下,名词辨析,名词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,I would like ______ for breakfast.,"[""a glass of milk"", ""a glass of water"", ""a glass of juice"", ""a glass of tea""]",A,句意是“我早餐想要一杯牛奶”。milk 是不可数名词，不能直接说 a milk、two milks 或 many milk；表示“一杯牛奶”应说 a glass of milk。,"[""名词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42315,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp17.json,六年级,英语,下,名词辨析,名词辨析,选择题,基础,0.38,2,There are three ______ playing in the park.,"[""child"", ""childs"", ""children"", ""childes""]",C,child意为“孩子”，复数形式为children；句中的three表示三个，所以要用复数。,"[""名词辨析""]"
congcong-school_42316,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp17.json,六年级,英语,下,名词辨析,名词辨析,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Look at the ______ on the wall. It tells us the time.,"[""clock"", ""door"", ""bed"", ""window""]",A,clock意为“钟”，可以告诉人们时间；door意为“门”，bed意为“床”，window意为“窗户”。,"[""名词辨析""]"
