congcong-school_42323,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u4-kp19.json,六年级,英语,下,时间介词,时间介词,填空题,基础,0.25,1,"Thirty years _____ , there were no computers in our class.",,ago,ago 放在表示时间长度的词语之后，表示“……以前”。Thirty years ago 意为“三十年前”，句子使用一般过去时 were。,"[""时间介词""]"
