congcong-school_42415,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u5-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 5 单元挑战,情景交际,选择题,中等,0.55,3,How can I get to the Fuxing Hospital? ____,"[""It's near."", ""Take the No. 5 bus."", ""I like it."", ""It's cold.""]",B,询问如何到达某地，应回答交通方式或路线。,"[""情景交际""]"
congcong-school_42416,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u5-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 5 单元挑战,冠词用法,选择题,基础,0.25,1,He has ____ idea for the weekend.,"[""a"", ""an"", ""some"", ""two""]",B,idea以元音音素/aɪ/开头，用an。,"[""冠词用法""]"
congcong-school_42417,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u5-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 5 单元挑战,词汇归类,填空题,基础,0.38,2,"Spring, summer, autumn and ____ are four seasons.",,winter,四季包括：春夏秋冬。,"[""词汇归类""]"
congcong-school_42418,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u5-exam.json,六年级,英语,下,第 5 单元挑战,一般将来时,填空题,基础,0.25,1,I ____ going to buy a comic book.,,am,主语是I，be动词用am。,"[""一般将来时""]"
