congcong-school_42507,congcong-school,english-g6down/lessons/english-g6down-u5-kp9.json,六年级,英语,下,词汇分类,词汇分类,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Which word doesn't belong to the others?（哪一个单词不属于同一类？）,"[""apple"", ""banana"", ""carrot"", ""pear""]",C,apple、banana 和 pear 都是水果；carrot（胡萝卜）是蔬菜。,"[""词汇分类""]"
