congcong-school_42745,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u3-kp14.json,六年级,英语,上,时间状语,时间状语,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选出时间状语和动词形式搭配正确的句子。,"[""I go to the park yesterday."", ""I went to the park yesterday."", ""I will go to the park yesterday."", ""I am going to the park yesterday.""]",B,“Yesterday”表示“昨天”，说明动作发生在过去，因此应使用一般过去时“went”。,"[""时间状语""]"
congcong-school_42746,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u3-kp14.json,六年级,英语,上,时间状语,时间状语,选择题,基础,0.25,1,______ I will visit my grandma.,"[""Yesterday"", ""Tomorrow"", ""Last week"", ""A year ago""]",B,tomorrow表示“明天”，是将来的时间状语。句子表示明天将去看望奶奶，因此用will visit。,"[""时间状语""]"
congcong-school_42747,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u3-kp14.json,六年级,英语,上,时间状语,时间状语,选择题,基础,0.38,2,We saw a big dog three days ______.,"[""ago"", ""next"", ""last"", ""tomorrow""]",A,表示“……以前”时，ago放在时间词后面，因此应说 three days ago。,"[""时间状语""]"
