congcong-school_42932,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,Hobbies sentence,Hobbies sentence,填空题,基础,0.25,1,"连词成句：[likes, stories, reading, He]",,"He,likes,reading,stories",陈述句语序为主语+谓语+其他部分。主语He是第三人称单数，所以用likes；like后接动作时用reading。,"[""Hobbies sentence""]"
