congcong-school_42934,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,Hobbies sentence,Hobbies sentence,填空题,基础,0.25,1,填空：She _____ drawing pictures.,,likes,主语She是第三人称单数，描述她喜欢做某事时，like要变为likes。,"[""Hobbies sentence""]"
