congcong-school_42964,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp5.json,六年级,英语,上,Grammar: Subject-verb agreement,Grammar: Subject-verb agreement,选择题,基础,0.38,2,选择正确的词填空：My brother ______ to school by bus.,"[""A. goes"", ""B. go"", ""C. going"", ""D. are go""]",A,主语 My brother 是第三人称单数，动词 go 要加 -es，故选 goes。,"[""Grammar: Subject-verb agreement""]"
congcong-school_42965,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp5.json,六年级,英语,上,Grammar: Subject-verb agreement,Grammar: Subject-verb agreement,填空题,基础,0.38,2,用正确的 be 动词填空：You and Jack ______ good friends.,,are,You 和 Jack 由 and 连接，表示两个人，作复数主语，因此 be 动词用 are。,"[""Grammar: Subject-verb agreement""]"
congcong-school_42966,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp5.json,六年级,英语,上,Grammar: Subject-verb agreement,Grammar: Subject-verb agreement,判断题,基础,0.38,2,判断句子是否正确：The dogs is hungry.,,错,“The dogs”是复数主语，应搭配 are。原句应改为 “The dogs are hungry.”,"[""Grammar: Subject-verb agreement""]"
congcong-school_42967,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp6.json,六年级,英语,上,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,判断题,基础,0.38,2,询问对方的爱好，可以说 “What is your hobby?”。,,对,What is your hobby? 是以 what 开头的特殊疑问句，用来询问对方的爱好。,"[""Grammar: Interrogative sentence""]"
congcong-school_42968,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp6.json,六年级,英语,上,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,选择题,基础,0.25,1,选择对 “Are you a student?” 的正确回答。,"[""A. Yes, I do."", ""B. Yes, I am."", ""C. Yes, I can.""]",B,"一般疑问句可以用 Yes 或 No 回答。Are you a student? 的肯定回答是 Yes, I am.","[""Grammar: Interrogative sentence""]"
congcong-school_42969,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp6.json,六年级,英语,上,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,填空题,基础,0.25,1,填入合适的疑问词：________ do you live?,,Where,询问地点用 where。特殊疑问词放在句首，因此完整句子是 Where do you live?,"[""Grammar: Interrogative sentence""]"
congcong-school_42970,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp6.json,六年级,英语,上,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,填空题,基础,0.38,2,填入合适的助动词：________ Amy read books every day?,,Does,主语 Amy 是第三人称单数，一般现在时的一般疑问句要用 Does 开头，后面的实义动词用原形 read。,"[""Grammar: Interrogative sentence""]"
congcong-school_42971,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp6.json,六年级,英语,上,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,填空题,基础,0.38,2,将词语排列成正确的疑问句：your / name / is / what,,What is your name?,询问姓名用 What。特殊疑问词放在句首，接 be 动词和主语，句末用问号。,"[""Grammar: Interrogative sentence""]"
congcong-school_42972,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp6.json,六年级,英语,上,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,Grammar: Interrogative sentence,选择题,基础,0.38,2,选择正确的一般疑问句。,"[""A. Does Tom happy?"", ""B. Tom is happy?"", ""C. Is Tom happy?""]",C,句中有 be 动词 is，构成一般疑问句时把 is 放在主语 Tom 前面，因此应为 Is Tom happy?,"[""Grammar: Interrogative sentence""]"
congcong-school_42973,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp7.json,六年级,英语,上,Hobbies,Hobbies,选择题,基础,0.25,1,I like ________ English words.,"[""study"", ""studies"", ""studying"", ""studied""]",C,like 后接动词-ing形式表示喜欢做某事，因此 study 要变为 studying。,"[""Hobbies""]"
congcong-school_42974,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp7.json,六年级,英语,上,Hobbies,Hobbies,选择题,基础,0.25,1,My sister likes ________.,"[""sing"", ""singing"", ""sings"", ""is sing""]",B,表达喜欢唱歌时，like 后用动词-ing形式：like singing。,"[""Hobbies""]"
