congcong-school_42978,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp7.json,六年级,英语,上,Hobbies,Hobbies,填空题,基础,0.25,1,Amy ________ reading storybooks. (like),,likes,主语 Amy 是第三人称单数，因此用 likes。表达爱好时，后面的 read 用动词-ing形式 reading。,"[""Hobbies""]"
congcong-school_42979,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp8.json,六年级,英语,上,Vocabulary: hobbies,Vocabulary: hobbies,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Oliver likes ________ kung fu.,"[""doing"", ""does"", ""did"", ""do""]",A,表达“练功夫”常用 do kung fu。like 后描述活动时通常接动词-ing形式，因此用 doing。,"[""Vocabulary: hobbies""]"
congcong-school_42980,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp8.json,六年级,英语,上,Vocabulary: hobbies,Vocabulary: hobbies,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Mia likes ________ chess after school.,"[""playing"", ""going"", ""doing"", ""making""]",A,play chess 表示“下棋”；like 后描述活动时用动词-ing形式，所以填 playing。,"[""Vocabulary: hobbies""]"
congcong-school_42981,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp8.json,六年级,英语,上,Vocabulary: hobbies,Vocabulary: hobbies,选择题,基础,0.25,1,I often ________ swimming on Sundays.,"[""go"", ""goes"", ""going"", ""does""]",A,go swimming 是“去游泳”的常见表达。句子主语是 I，因此用 go。,"[""Vocabulary: hobbies""]"
congcong-school_42982,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp8.json,六年级,英语,上,Vocabulary: hobbies,Vocabulary: hobbies,填空题,基础,0.25,1,My hobby is ________. (draw),,drawing,draw 表示“画画”，drawing 表示“画画这项活动”。like 后可接动词-ing形式。,"[""Vocabulary: hobbies""]"
congcong-school_42983,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp8.json,六年级,英语,上,Vocabulary: hobbies,Vocabulary: hobbies,判断题,基础,0.25,1,“She likes singing.”的意思是“她喜欢唱歌”。,,True,singing 的意思是“唱歌”，所以“She likes singing.”表示“她喜欢唱歌”。,"[""Vocabulary: hobbies""]"
congcong-school_42984,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp8.json,六年级,英语,上,Vocabulary: hobbies,Vocabulary: hobbies,填空题,基础,0.38,2,用英语写出“打篮球”这项爱好，并补全句子：I like ________.,,playing basketball,“打篮球”用 play basketball；在 like 后描述活动时用动词-ing形式，故为 playing basketball。,"[""Vocabulary: hobbies""]"
