congcong-school_42986,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp9.json,六年级,英语,上,Third person singular,Third person singular,选择题,中等,0.55,3,Emma ________ coffee.,"[""doesn't like"", ""doesn't likes"", ""don't like"", ""not likes""]",A,主语 Emma 是第三人称单数，否定句使用 doesn’t + 动词原形，因此填 doesn’t like，不能写 doesn’t likes。,"[""Third person singular""]"
congcong-school_42987,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp9.json,六年级,英语,上,Third person singular,Third person singular,选择题,基础,0.38,2,The dog ________ a long tail.,"[""have"", ""has"", ""haves"", ""having""]",B,主语 The dog 是第三人称单数；have 的第三人称单数形式是不规则变化 has。,"[""Third person singular""]"
congcong-school_42988,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u4-kp9.json,六年级,英语,上,Third person singular,Third person singular,选择题,中等,0.55,3,选择正确的一般疑问句。,"[""Does Tom walks to school every day?"", ""Does Tom walk to school every day?"", ""Do Tom walk to school every day?"", ""Is Tom walk to school every day?""]",B,一般现在时的一般疑问句中，第三人称单数使用 Does 开头；助动词后面的行为动词用原形 walk。,"[""Third person singular""]"
