congcong-school_43062,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp18.json,六年级,英语,上,职业规划,职业规划,填空题,基础,0.38,2,I want to fly a plane. I want to be a ______.,,pilot,pilot 是“飞行员”。句型“I want to be a ...”表示“我想成为一名……”。,"[""职业规划""]"
congcong-school_43063,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp18.json,六年级,英语,上,职业规划,职业规划,填空题,中等,0.55,3,用英语写一句话：我想成为一名教师，因为我喜欢孩子。,,I want to be a teacher because I like children.,用“I want to be a/an + 职业”表达职业理想，再用“because”说明原因。teacher 前用 a。,"[""职业规划""]"
congcong-school_43064,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,职业词汇,职业词汇,填空题,基础,0.25,1,A person who flies a plane is a ______.,,pilot,A person who flies a plane is a pilot，意思是“驾驶飞机的人是飞行员”。,"[""职业词汇""]"
