congcong-school_43067,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,职业词汇,职业词汇,填空题,基础,0.38,2,My aunt works in a hospital and takes care of patients. She is a ______.,,nurse,Nurse 是“护士”。字母 n 的发音是辅音音素，因此前面用 a：a nurse。,"[""职业词汇""]"
congcong-school_43068,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,职业词汇,职业词汇,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Choose the correct sentence.,"[""She is a artist."", ""She is an artist."", ""She are an artist."", ""She is an teacher.""]",B,Artist 意为“艺术家”，以元音音素开头，因此前面用 an。完整句子是 She is an artist.,"[""职业词汇""]"
congcong-school_43069,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,职业词汇,职业词汇,选择题,基础,0.38,2,A: What does your grandfather do? B: ______,"[""He is a farmer."", ""She is a doctor."", ""He flies a plane.""]",A,What does he do? 用来询问男性的职业；farmer 意为“农民”，回答为 He is a farmer.,"[""职业词汇""]"
congcong-school_43070,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,职业及通勤方式的询问,职业及通勤方式的询问,选择题,基础,0.25,1,想问“你爸爸是做什么工作的？”，应说：,"[""What is your father do?"", ""What does your father do?"", ""How does your father do?""]",B,询问某人做什么工作，常用“What does … do?”，所以选B。,"[""职业及通勤方式的询问""]"
congcong-school_43071,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,职业及通勤方式的询问,职业及通勤方式的询问,填空题,基础,0.25,1,连词成句：Amy / how / go to work / does?,,How does Amy go to work?,询问第三人称单数如何上班，用“How does + 人 + go to work?”。does后面的动词用原形go。,"[""职业及通勤方式的询问""]"
congcong-school_43072,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,职业及通勤方式的询问,职业及通勤方式的询问,填空题,基础,0.25,1,My uncle is ___ actor.（填a或an）,,an,actor以元音音素开头，因此职业前用an。,"[""职业及通勤方式的询问""]"
