congcong-school_43074,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,职业及通勤方式的询问,职业及通勤方式的询问,判断题,基础,0.25,1,“How does he go to work? — He goes to work on foot.” 这组问答表达正确吗？,,True,询问某人如何上班可以说“How does he go to work?”；回答步行时用“on foot”。,"[""职业及通勤方式的询问""]"
congcong-school_43075,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,职业及通勤方式的询问,职业及通勤方式的询问,选择题,基础,0.38,2,选择一组正确的问答。,"[""A: What does your mother do? B: She is teacher. A: How does she go to work? B: She goes to work by bike."", ""A: What do your mother do? B: She is a teacher. A: How does she goes to work? B: She goes to work by bike."", ""A: What does your mother do? B: She is a teacher. A: How does she go to work? B: She goes to work by bike.""]",C,回答职业可以说“She is a teacher.”；回答通勤方式可以说“She goes to work by bike.”，两句都符合语法和语境。,"[""职业及通勤方式的询问""]"
congcong-school_43076,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp20.json,六年级,英语,上,动词形式,动词形式,填空题,基础,0.38,2,Sarah ______ (study) very hard.,,studies,主语Sarah是第三人称单数，句子表示一般现在时。study以辅音字母+y结尾，变y为i再加-es，写作studies。,"[""动词形式""]"
