congcong-school_43079,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp20.json,六年级,英语,上,动词形式,动词形式,填空题,基础,0.38,2,We ______ (go) to the park yesterday.,,went,yesterday表示过去，go是不规则动词，其过去式是went。,"[""动词形式""]"
congcong-school_43080,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp20.json,六年级,英语,上,动词形式,动词形式,填空题,基础,0.25,1,My little sister can ______ (eat) by herself.,,eat,情态动词can后接动词原形，因此使用eat，不加-s或其他词尾。,"[""动词形式""]"
congcong-school_43081,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp20.json,六年级,英语,上,动词形式,动词形式,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Choose the correct answer: The boys and their teacher ______ in the classroom now.,"[""is"", ""are"", ""am"", ""be""]",B,"The subject “The boys and their teacher” refers to more than one person, so the correct be verb is “are.” “Now” shows the sentence describes the present situation.","[""动词形式""]"
