congcong-school_43100,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp24.json,六年级,英语,上,职业与工作内容匹配,职业与工作内容匹配,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Which sentence correctly matches a job with its work?,"[""A postman delivers letters."", ""A police officer helps people and keeps them safe."", ""A head teacher delivers letters."", ""A post office helps people and keeps them safe.""]",B,“Police officer”是“警察”的意思，警察帮助人们并保护他们的安全。其他选项分别是“邮递员”“校长”和“邮局”。,"[""职业与工作内容匹配""]"
congcong-school_43101,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u5-kp24.json,六年级,英语,上,职业与工作内容匹配,职业与工作内容匹配,填空题,基础,0.25,1,A ______ helps people and keeps them safe.（一位______帮助人们并保护他们的安全。）,,police officer,police officer 意为“警察”。警察帮助人们并维护安全。,"[""职业与工作内容匹配""]"
