congcong-school_43172,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u6-kp10.json,六年级,英语,上,建议短语,建议短语,填空题,基础,0.38,2,你的同学不懂数学题，请用“Why don’t you…?”给他提一条建议。,,Why don't you ask your teacher for help?,“Why don’t you + 动词原形…?”可用来提出建议；ask用动词原形。,"[""建议短语""]"
congcong-school_43173,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u6-kp10.json,六年级,英语,上,建议短语,建议短语,填空题,基础,0.38,2,How about ______ (read) this book together?,,reading,“How about”后面接名词或动词-ing形式，因此read要变为reading。,"[""建议短语""]"
