congcong-school_43176,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u6-kp10.json,六年级,英语,上,建议短语,建议短语,填空题,中等,0.55,3,把词语组成一个建议句：about / How / to the park / going,,How about going to the park?,“How about”后接动词-ing形式，所以go应改为going；该句可用于建议去公园。,"[""建议短语""]"
congcong-school_43177,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u6-kp11.json,六年级,英语,上,动词短语,动词短语,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Sam is ______ his football.,"[""sit on"", ""looking for"", ""talk about"", ""goes to""]",B,look for 意为“寻找”。句中有 is，表示现在正在做的动作，因此用现在进行时 is looking for。,"[""动词短语""]"
congcong-school_43178,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u6-kp11.json,六年级,英语,上,动词短语,动词短语,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Amy ______ at seven every morning.,"[""gets up"", ""looks for"", ""turns on"", ""talks about""]",A,get up 意为“起床”。主语 Amy 是第三人称单数，句子描述日常习惯，动词用 gets。,"[""动词短语""]"
