congcong-school_43184,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u6-kp12.json,六年级,英语,上,逻辑理解,逻辑理解,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Choose the sentence that means “昨晚下雨了，所以地面是湿的”。,"[""The ground is wet, but it did not rain last night."", ""The ground is wet because it rained last night."", ""It rained last night, but the ground is dry."", ""The ground will be wet if it rains tonight.""]",B,“because”表示原因：昨晚下雨是原因，地面湿是结果。选项2表达了相同的因果关系。,"[""逻辑理解""]"
congcong-school_43185,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u6-kp12.json,六年级,英语,上,逻辑理解,逻辑理解,选择题,基础,0.38,2,选出表示“天气很冷，所以我穿上了外套”的句子。,"[""It was cold, but I put on my coat."", ""It was cold, so I put on my coat."", ""It was cold because I put on my coat."", ""If it was cold, I put on my coat.""]",B,天气冷是原因，穿上外套是因此采取的行动。so 表示“所以”。,"[""逻辑理解""]"
