congcong-school_43188,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u6-kp12.json,六年级,英语,上,逻辑理解,逻辑理解,填空题,中等,0.55,3,Ben got up late this morning. He missed the bus and arrived at school after the bell rang. Why was Ben late for school?,,"He missed the bus, so he was late for school.",短文说明本迟到了，因为他错过了公交车。原因是错过公交车，结果是上学迟到。,"[""逻辑理解""]"
congcong-school_43189,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u6-kp13.json,六年级,英语,上,语法结构,语法结构,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"If you follow the rules, the teachers will be ______.","[""angry"", ""happy"", ""bad"", ""sad""]",B,遵守规则，老师会高兴。will 后接 be，be 后可以接形容词 happy。,"[""语法结构""]"
congcong-school_43190,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u6-kp13.json,六年级,英语,上,语法结构,语法结构,填空题,基础,0.38,2,"If he ______ (get) up early, he will catch the bus.",,gets,这是 if 引导的条件句，条件部分通常用一般现在时。主语 he 是第三人称单数，因此用 gets。,"[""语法结构""]"
