congcong-school_43294,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,寓言寓意,判断题,中等,0.55,3,The moral of a story is the same as the setting.,,错,moral指故事寓意，setting指背景，两者不同。,"[""寓言寓意""]"
congcong-school_43295,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,地点的介词,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Turn left ______ the bookstore. Then go straight.,"[""on"", ""in"", ""at"", ""with""]",C,在某个具体的地点转弯用at。,"[""地点的介词""]"
congcong-school_43296,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,将来时间状语,选择题,基础,0.38,2,We are going to have a party ______.,"[""yesterday"", ""last week"", ""now"", ""this evening""]",D,are going to 配合将来时间，this evening符合。,"[""将来时间状语""]"
congcong-school_43297,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,寓言故事要素,选择题,中等,0.55,3,The ______ are the people or animals in a story.,"[""Settings"", ""Plots"", ""Characters"", ""Morals""]",C,故事中的人物或动物被称为角色。,"[""寓言故事要素""]"
congcong-school_43298,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,职业地点配套,选择题,基础,0.38,2,A postman works in a ______.,"[""hospital"", ""post office"", ""school"", ""gym""]",B,邮递员在邮局工作。,"[""职业地点配套""]"
congcong-school_43299,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,谓语动词三单,选择题,基础,0.38,2,My father ______ to work by subway.,"[""go"", ""going"", ""goes"", ""to go""]",C,主语my father是第三人称单数，动词加es。,"[""谓语动词三单""]"
congcong-school_43300,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,建议与忠告,选择题,中等,0.55,3,Someone is ill. You should say: ______.,"[""Happy birthday!"", ""See a doctor."", ""Good job!"", ""Count to ten.""]",B,生病时的建议是看医生。,"[""建议与忠告""]"
congcong-school_43301,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,句型填充,填空题,基础,0.25,1,______ is the cinema? It's near the park.,,where,询问地点的疑问词。,"[""句型填充""]"
