congcong-school_43303,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,故事要素,填空题,中等,0.55,3,The end of a story is part of the ______.,,plot,故事的结尾属于情节(plot)的一部分。,"[""故事要素""]"
congcong-school_43304,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,动作英汉配对,连线题,基础,0.38,2,匹配动作短语与其含义。,,"A-2,B-4,C-1,D-3","A-左转, B-乘车, C-生气, D-远足。","[""动作英汉配对""]"
congcong-school_43305,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-exam.json,六年级,英语,上,第 7 单元挑战,生活习惯,其他,基础,0.38,2,请将下列单词连成一句话：,,"I,often,clean,my,room",频度副词放在实义动词前。,"[""生活习惯""]"
congcong-school_43306,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp1.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,选择题,基础,0.25,1,"Read the story: “One morning, a Crow found a piece of cheese. A Fox wanted it, so he praised the Crow’s voice. The Crow opened her beak to sing, and the cheese fell. The Fox took it.” Who are the characters?","[""The forest"", ""The cheese"", ""The Fox and the Crow"", ""One morning""]",C,人物是故事中参与事件的角色。The Fox（狐狸）和 the Crow（乌鸦）都是故事人物。,"[""寓言故事要素拆解与理解""]"
congcong-school_43307,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp1.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,选择题,基础,0.25,1,"In the story about the Fox and the Crow, why did the Fox praise the Crow?","[""He wanted to teach the Crow a song."", ""He wanted to get the cheese."", ""He wanted to build a nest."", ""He wanted to leave the forest.""]",B,狐狸夸奖乌鸦，是为了让乌鸦张嘴唱歌，好让奶酪掉下来。这是故事中的问题和狐狸的目的。,"[""寓言故事要素拆解与理解""]"
congcong-school_43308,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp1.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,判断题,基础,0.25,1,"In the story about the Fox and the Crow, the cheese fell when the Crow opened her beak.",,True,乌鸦一张嘴唱歌，奶酪就掉了，狐狸最终拿到了奶酪。判断寓言情节时，要关注行为带来的结果。,"[""寓言故事要素拆解与理解""]"
congcong-school_43309,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp1.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,填空题,基础,0.38,2,Complete the sentence with one word: The Fox and the Crow teaches us to be careful of ________.（狐狸和乌鸦的故事告诉我们要小心________。）,,flattery,狐狸利用赞美让乌鸦放松警惕并张嘴唱歌，因此故事提醒我们不要轻信奉承。flattery 意为“奉承、谄媚”。,"[""寓言故事要素拆解与理解""]"
congcong-school_43310,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp1.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"An Ant stores food for winter, but a Grasshopper spends the summer singing and playing. When winter comes, the Grasshopper has no food. Which lesson best fits this fable?","[""The Ant and the Grasshopper"", ""The Fox and the Crow"", ""The Lion and the Mouse"", ""The Tortoise and the Hare""]",A,蚂蚁提前储存食物，蚱蜢却只顾玩耍；冬天到来后，蚱蜢没有食物。因此故事强调提前准备的重要性。,"[""寓言故事要素拆解与理解""]"
congcong-school_43311,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp1.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,寓言故事要素拆解与理解,填空题,中等,0.55,3,"A Hare laughs at a slow Tortoise and challenges him to a race. The Hare runs ahead, then stops to rest. The Tortoise keeps moving and reaches the finish first. In English, briefly explain why the Tortoise wins and what lesson the story teaches.",,"The Tortoise wins the race because he keeps going steadily, while the Hare stops to rest. The story teaches us not to be overconfident and to keep trying.",答案按事件顺序概括：兔子停下休息，乌龟坚持前进，最终乌龟获胜；寓意从两者的行为和结果中得出。只写“乌龟赢了”还没有说明原因和道理。,"[""寓言故事要素拆解与理解""]"
congcong-school_43312,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp10.json,六年级,英语,上,建议引导词,建议引导词,选择题,基础,0.25,1,You should ______ a deep breath and count to ten.,"[""takes"", ""taking"", ""take"", ""took""]",C,should 是情态动词，后面接动词原形，因此选 take。,"[""建议引导词""]"
congcong-school_43313,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp10.json,六年级,英语,上,建议引导词,建议引导词,填空题,基础,0.25,1,用括号中单词的正确形式填空：______ your teacher for help? (ask),,Why not ask,Why not 后面接动词原形，ask your teacher 意为“问问你的老师”。,"[""建议引导词""]"
congcong-school_43314,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp10.json,六年级,英语,上,建议引导词,建议引导词,判断题,基础,0.25,1,判断正误：You’d better see a doctor if you feel ill.,,T,had better 后面接动词原形，句中的 see 使用正确。,"[""建议引导词""]"
congcong-school_43315,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp10.json,六年级,英语,上,建议引导词,建议引导词,填空题,基础,0.38,2,______ read books together after school.（我们放学后一起读书吧。）,,Let’s,Let’s 后接动词原形，Let’s read books together 表示“我们一起读书吧”。,"[""建议引导词""]"
congcong-school_43316,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp10.json,六年级,英语,上,建议引导词,建议引导词,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"It’s hot outside. ______ some water, please.","[""Drinks"", ""Drinking"", ""Drink"", ""Drank""]",drink,祈使句表示建议或指示时，通常以动词原形开头，所以用 Drink。,"[""建议引导词""]"
congcong-school_43317,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp10.json,六年级,英语,上,建议引导词,建议引导词,填空题,基础,0.38,2,在图书馆里不要跑。______ in the library. (run),,Don’t run,否定祈使句的结构是 Don’t + 动词原形，因此填 Don’t run。,"[""建议引导词""]"
congcong-school_43318,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp11.json,六年级,英语,上,场所及交通方式配套,场所及交通方式配套,选择题,基础,0.25,1,"If you want to go to the park, you can go ______ bus.","[""on"", ""by"", ""with"", ""at""]",B,by + 交通工具表示出行方式，乘公共汽车说 by bus。,"[""场所及交通方式配套""]"
congcong-school_43319,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp11.json,六年级,英语,上,场所及交通方式配套,场所及交通方式配套,选择题,基础,0.25,1,The school is near my home. I can go there ______.,"[""by foot"", ""on foot"", ""by bus"", ""with foot""]",B,步行的固定表达是 on foot，不能说 by foot。,"[""场所及交通方式配套""]"
congcong-school_43320,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp11.json,六年级,英语,上,场所及交通方式配套,场所及交通方式配套,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Tom rides his bicycle to the park. He goes there ______.,"[""by train"", ""by bike"", ""by subway"", ""on foot""]",B,骑自行车可以说 by bike。,"[""场所及交通方式配套""]"
congcong-school_43321,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp11.json,六年级,英语,上,场所及交通方式配套,场所及交通方式配套,选择题,基础,0.38,2,—______ do you go to the library? —I go there by bus.,"[""Where"", ""When"", ""How"", ""Who""]",C,询问怎样去某地，用 How 开头：How do you go to the library?,"[""场所及交通方式配套""]"
congcong-school_43322,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp11.json,六年级,英语,上,场所及交通方式配套,场所及交通方式配套,选择题,基础,0.38,2,The city is far away. We can go there ______.,"[""on foot"", ""by bike"", ""by train"", ""by boat""]",C,乘火车去远处的城市，可以说 go there by train。,"[""场所及交通方式配套""]"
congcong-school_43323,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp11.json,六年级,英语,上,场所及交通方式配套,场所及交通方式配套,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Amy lives far from the city library. She can go there ______.,"[""by subway"", ""on foot"", ""by bike"", ""by ship""]",A,乘地铁去市图书馆可以说 go to the city library by subway。,"[""场所及交通方式配套""]"
congcong-school_43324,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp12.json,六年级,英语,上,综合问路表达,综合问路表达,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Where is the post office? It's ______ the hospital.,"[""next to"", ""under"", ""at"", ""in""]",A,next to 表示“在……旁边”。句意是“邮局在医院旁边”。,"[""综合问路表达""]"
congcong-school_43325,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp12.json,六年级,英语,上,综合问路表达,综合问路表达,填空题,基础,0.25,1,问路前可以说“__________.”，表示“打扰一下”。,,Excuse me,Excuse me. 常用于礼貌地引起他人注意或开始问路。,"[""综合问路表达""]"
congcong-school_43326,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp12.json,六年级,英语,上,综合问路表达,综合问路表达,填空题,基础,0.38,2,请用英语写出“图书馆在哪里？”,,Where is the library?,Where is the ...? 用来询问某个地点在哪里。,"[""综合问路表达""]"
congcong-school_43327,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp12.json,六年级,英语,上,综合问路表达,综合问路表达,选择题,基础,0.38,2,“向左转。”用英语怎么说？,"[""Go straight."", ""Turn left."", ""Turn right."", ""Stop here.""]",B,Turn left. 表示“向左转”，是常用的指路表达。,"[""综合问路表达""]"
congcong-school_43328,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp12.json,六年级,英语,上,综合问路表达,综合问路表达,选择题,基础,0.38,2,The cinema is ______ the park. It is on the other side of the street.,"[""next to"", ""across from"", ""between"", ""behind""]",B,across from 表示“在……对面”。,"[""综合问路表达""]"
congcong-school_43329,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp12.json,六年级,英语,上,综合问路表达,综合问路表达,填空题,中等,0.55,3,请根据提示组成一句指路语：直走，然后在书店向右转。（Go straight / turn right / at the bookstore）,,Go straight and turn right at the bookstore.,Go straight 表示“直走”，turn right 表示“向右转”，at the bookstore 表示“在书店处”。这些短语按顺序组成清楚的指路语句。,"[""综合问路表达""]"
congcong-school_43330,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp13.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事理解,寓言故事理解,选择题,基础,0.38,2,The Robin Hood story tells us we should ______.,"[""be mean"", ""stay at home"", ""help others"", ""be angry""]",C,罗宾汉帮助有困难的人，所以故事告诉我们要帮助他人。,"[""寓言故事理解""]"
congcong-school_43331,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp13.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事理解,寓言故事理解,判断题,基础,0.25,1,A fable often teaches us a lesson.,,True,寓言故事常通过角色的经历或行为告诉读者一个道理。,"[""寓言故事理解""]"
congcong-school_43332,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp13.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事理解,寓言故事理解,填空题,基础,0.25,1,A fable teaches us a ______.,,the lesson,“寓意”就是故事想告诉我们的道理，也可以用“the lesson”表达。,"[""寓言故事理解""]"
congcong-school_43333,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp13.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事理解,寓言故事理解,填空题,基础,0.38,2,We should ______ people in need.,,help,句意是“我们应该帮助有困难的人”。should后接动词原形，因此填help。,"[""寓言故事理解""]"
congcong-school_43334,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp13.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事理解,寓言故事理解,填空题,基础,0.38,2,A boy ignored his friends’ advice and got into trouble. What did the boy do before he got into trouble?,,He did not listen to advice.,故事中，那个男孩没有听取建议，结果遇到了麻烦。这说明我们应当认真听取有益的建议。,"[""寓言故事理解""]"
congcong-school_43335,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp13.json,六年级,英语,上,寓言故事理解,寓言故事理解,选择题,中等,0.55,3,A little bird shares food with a hungry rabbit. What lesson does the story most likely teach?,"[""be kind and helpful"", ""keep everything for yourself"", ""never talk to anyone"", ""be afraid of animals""]",A,小鸟帮助受伤的兔子，体现了友善和乐于助人。概括寓意时要从角色的行为中总结道理。,"[""寓言故事理解""]"
congcong-school_43336,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp14.json,六年级,英语,上,句意选择,句意选择,选择题,基础,0.25,1,What is your father's job? He is a ______.,"[""country"", ""hobby"", ""postman"", ""word""]",C,job 表示“工作、职业”，问题是在问爸爸的职业。postman（邮递员）是职业名称，其他选项不符合句意。,"[""句意选择""]"
congcong-school_43337,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp14.json,六年级,英语,上,句意选择,句意选择,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Where can you read many books? You can read them in the ______.,"[""library"", ""Monday"", ""teacher"", ""happy""]",A,问句中的 Where 询问地点。图书馆是读书的地方，因此选 library。,"[""句意选择""]"
congcong-school_43338,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp14.json,六年级,英语,上,句意选择,句意选择,选择题,基础,0.25,1,It is ______ today. Take an umbrella with you.,"[""sunny"", ""rainy"", ""windy"", ""cloudy""]",B,句意是“今天在下雨，所以你应该带一把雨伞”。rainy 表示“下雨的”，与带伞的情境相符。,"[""句意选择""]"
congcong-school_43339,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp14.json,六年级,英语,上,句意选择,句意选择,选择题,基础,0.38,2,How do you go to school? I go to school ______.,"[""at seven"", ""by bus"", ""in the park"", ""my brother""]",B,问句中的 How 询问方式。by bus 表示“乘公共汽车”，是表示出行方式的回答。,"[""句意选择""]"
congcong-school_43340,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp14.json,六年级,英语,上,句意选择,句意选择,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Why do you like spring? ______ it is warm and beautiful.,"[""but"", ""because"", ""or"", ""so""]",B,答句说明了喜欢春天的原因，因此用 because（因为）连接原因。,"[""句意选择""]"
congcong-school_43341,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp14.json,六年级,英语,上,句意选择,句意选择,选择题,基础,0.38,2,I am thirsty after playing football. I want to drink some ______.,"[""water"", ""bread"", ""rice"", ""meat""]",A,句意是“运动后我很渴，所以我喝一些水”。water（水）符合“口渴”这一语境。,"[""句意选择""]"
congcong-school_43342,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp15.json,六年级,英语,上,打算与计划,打算与计划,选择题,基础,0.38,2,What ______ you going to do this weekend?,"[""is"", ""be"", ""are"", ""am""]",C,主语是you，be动词用are。,"[""打算与计划""]"
congcong-school_43343,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp15.json,六年级,英语,上,打算与计划,打算与计划,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Which sentence is correct?,"[""I am going to read a book tonight."", ""I is going to read a book tonight."", ""I are going to read a book tonight."", ""I am going read a book tonight.""]",A,主语是I，be动词用am；be going to后接动词原形read。,"[""打算与计划""]"
congcong-school_43344,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp15.json,六年级,英语,上,打算与计划,打算与计划,填空题,基础,0.38,2,______ they going to play football after school?,,Are,一般疑问句要把be动词放在主语前；主语you对应are。,"[""打算与计划""]"
congcong-school_43345,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp15.json,六年级,英语,上,打算与计划,打算与计划,填空题,基础,0.38,2,Lucy ______ ______ ______ her aunt tomorrow.（打算去看望）,,is going to,主语Lucy是第三人称单数，be动词用is；be going to后接动词原形visit。,"[""打算与计划""]"
congcong-school_43346,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp15.json,六年级,英语,上,打算与计划,打算与计划,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"“Is Tom going to swim today?” “______, ______ ______.”","[""Yes, he is."", ""No, he isn't."", ""No, he aren't."", ""Yes, he isn't.""]",B,"问句主语是he，简短否定回答用“No, he isn't.”。","[""打算与计划""]"
congcong-school_43347,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp15.json,六年级,英语,上,打算与计划,打算与计划,填空题,中等,0.55,3,把句子补完整：We ______ ______ ______ a picnic on Sunday.（打算去野餐）,,are going to,主语we对应are；be going to后接动词原形have。,"[""打算与计划""]"
congcong-school_43348,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp16.json,六年级,英语,上,爱好表达,爱好表达,选择题,基础,0.38,2,He likes ______ stories and singing.,"[""read"", ""reads"", ""reading"", ""to reads""]",C,like 后接表示爱好的动作时，常用动词-ing形式，因此 read 变为 reading。,"[""爱好表达""]"
congcong-school_43349,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp16.json,六年级,英语,上,爱好表达,爱好表达,填空题,基础,0.25,1,用 swim 和 like 写一句话，表达“她喜欢游泳”。,,She likes swimming.,主语 She 是第三人称单数，like 要变为 likes；表示爱好的动作 swim 用动词-ing形式 swimming。,"[""爱好表达""]"
congcong-school_43350,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp16.json,六年级,英语,上,爱好表达,爱好表达,判断题,基础,0.25,1,“我喜欢画画”可以说“I like drawing.”。,,T,表达“我喜欢画画”可以说“I like drawing.”，like 后接动词-ing形式。,"[""爱好表达""]"
congcong-school_43351,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp16.json,六年级,英语,上,爱好表达,爱好表达,填空题,基础,0.38,2,I like ______ basketball after school.（play）,,playing,like 后接表示爱好的动作时，常用动词-ing形式，因此 play 要变为 playing。,"[""爱好表达""]"
congcong-school_43352,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp16.json,六年级,英语,上,爱好表达,爱好表达,填空题,基础,0.38,2,根据提示写句子：他的爱好是集邮。（collect stamps）,,His hobby is collecting stamps.,“他的爱好是……”可以用“His hobby is ...”表达；collect 表示动作时可用 collecting。,"[""爱好表达""]"
congcong-school_43353,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp16.json,六年级,英语,上,爱好表达,爱好表达,填空题,基础,0.38,2,My sister ______ reading books.（like）,,likes,My sister 是第三人称单数，主句中的 like 要加-s，写成 likes。,"[""爱好表达""]"
congcong-school_43354,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp17.json,六年级,英语,上,情绪识别,情绪识别,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Your dog is ill. You are very ______.,"[""happy"", ""sad"", ""excited"", ""angry""]",B,宠物生病了，主人通常会感到难过，所以选 sad。,"[""情绪识别""]"
congcong-school_43355,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp17.json,六年级,英语,上,情绪识别,情绪识别,选择题,基础,0.25,1,You get a lovely birthday present. You feel ______.,"[""angry"", ""afraid"", ""happy"", ""sad""]",C,收到生日礼物通常会感到开心，happy 意为“开心的”。,"[""情绪识别""]"
congcong-school_43356,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp17.json,六年级,英语,上,情绪识别,情绪识别,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"You have a big test tomorrow, and you are not ready. You feel ______.","[""excited"", ""worried"", ""happy"", ""tired""]",B,考试前担心自己能否做好，通常会感到 worried，意思是“担心的”。,"[""情绪识别""]"
congcong-school_43357,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp17.json,六年级,英语,上,情绪识别,情绪识别,选择题,基础,0.38,2,You are alone in a dark room and hear a strange noise. You feel ______.,"[""afraid"", ""proud"", ""relaxed"", ""happy""]",A,一个人在黑暗的房间里听到奇怪的声音，可能会感到害怕。afraid 意为“害怕的”。,"[""情绪识别""]"
congcong-school_43358,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp17.json,六年级,英语,上,情绪识别,情绪识别,选择题,基础,0.38,2,Someone takes your book without asking. You feel ______.,"[""sad"", ""excited"", ""angry"", ""sleepy""]",C,别人拿走了你的东西而没有询问，你可能会感到生气。angry 意为“生气的”。,"[""情绪识别""]"
congcong-school_43359,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp17.json,六年级,英语,上,情绪识别,情绪识别,选择题,基础,0.25,1,You are going on a trip you have been waiting for. You feel ______.,"[""tired"", ""excited"", ""worried"", ""angry""]",B,马上要去期待已久的旅行，通常会感到兴奋。excited 意为“兴奋的”。,"[""情绪识别""]"
congcong-school_43360,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp18.json,六年级,英语,上,语音与停顿,语音与停顿,选择题,中等,0.55,3,Which sentence has a natural pause (V)?,"[""Wait V for the V green light."", ""I want V to go V to the V cinema."", ""First, V go to the bookstore."", ""Turn V left V at the V light.""]",C,First 是句首的顺序词，后面逗号提示稍作停顿，因此这里的停顿较自然。,"[""语音与停顿""]"
congcong-school_43361,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp18.json,六年级,英语,上,语音与停顿,语音与停顿,填空题,基础,0.25,1,"Fill in the blank: ______, we wash our hands before lunch.",,"Then,",Then 表示接下来的步骤，放在句首时常在逗号处稍作停顿。,"[""语音与停顿""]"
congcong-school_43362,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp18.json,六年级,英语,上,语音与停顿,语音与停顿,判断题,基础,0.25,1,"True or False: When reading aloud, we usually pause briefly at a comma.",,True,逗号处通常稍作停顿，帮助听者分清句子的层次。,"[""语音与停顿""]"
congcong-school_43363,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp18.json,六年级,英语,上,语音与停顿,语音与停顿,选择题,基础,0.38,2,朗读句子“I want to read a book.”时，哪种停顿方式最自然？符号“/”表示稍作停顿。,"[""I want to read a book."", ""I want / to read a book."", ""I want to read / a book."", ""I want to / read a book.""]",A,“want to read a book”是意思紧密相连的部分，不应在“want”和“to”之间随意停顿。选项A没有在紧密相连的词组中间标出停顿；其他选项分别在不自然的位置标出了停顿。,"[""语音与停顿""]"
congcong-school_43364,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp18.json,六年级,英语,上,语音与停顿,语音与停顿,填空题,基础,0.38,2,"Add slashes (/) to show natural pauses: First, we go to school. Then, we have class.",,"First, / we go to school. / Then, / we have class.",First 和 Then 后的逗号可以提示轻微停顿；两个完整的小句之间也可以稍作停顿。,"[""语音与停顿""]"
congcong-school_43365,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp18.json,六年级,英语,上,语音与停顿,语音与停顿,选择题,基础,0.38,2,"Which option reads the instruction most naturally, with no unnecessary pause (V)?","[""Turn V left at the light."", ""Turn left V at the light."", ""Turn left at V the light."", ""Turn left at the light.""]",D,Turn left 和 at the light 都是紧密相连的词组，通常不在词组内部停顿。,"[""语音与停顿""]"
congcong-school_43366,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,问候基本功,问候基本功,填空题,基础,0.25,1,How ______ you today? I am fine.,,are,主语you配合be动词are进行提问。,"[""问候基本功""]"
congcong-school_43367,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,问候基本功,问候基本功,选择题,基础,0.25,1,Which word can you use to greet your friend?,"[""Goodbye"", ""Hello"", ""Sorry"", ""Thanks""]",B,Hello是常见的打招呼用语，可用于一天中的不同时间。,"[""问候基本功""]"
congcong-school_43368,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,问候基本功,问候基本功,填空题,基础,0.25,1,"It is 8:00 a.m. You meet your teacher. You can say, “________!”",,Good morning,上午见面时可以说Good morning，表示“早上好”。,"[""问候基本功""]"
congcong-school_43369,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,问候基本功,问候基本功,填空题,基础,0.38,2,"A: How are you?  B: I’m fine, ________. ________?",,Thank you. And you?,别人问“How are you?”时，可以先回答自己的情况，再礼貌地反问对方。,"[""问候基本功""]"
congcong-school_43370,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,问候基本功,问候基本功,填空题,基础,0.38,2,A: Nice to meet you.  B: ________,,"Nice to meet you, too.","对方说“Nice to meet you.”时，常回答“Nice to meet you, too.”，表示“我也很高兴认识你”。","[""问候基本功""]"
congcong-school_43371,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp19.json,六年级,英语,上,问候基本功,问候基本功,判断题,基础,0.25,1,“Goodbye” is a greeting you use when you meet someone.（判断正误）,,False,Goodbye用于告别，不是问候；见面打招呼可以说Hello或Hi。,"[""问候基本功""]"
congcong-school_43372,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,综合语言功能句型总结,综合语言功能句型总结,选择题,基础,0.25,1,你想问新同学“你来自哪里？”，应该说：,"[""What are you from?"", ""Where are you from?"", ""Who are you from?"", ""When are you from?""]",B,询问对方来自哪里，常用“Where are you from?”，回答可用“I’m from …”。,"[""综合语言功能句型总结""]"
congcong-school_43373,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,综合语言功能句型总结,综合语言功能句型总结,填空题,基础,0.25,1,请用英语写出“你能帮帮我吗？”。,,Can you help me?,向别人礼貌地询问能否帮忙，可以用“Can you help me?”。,"[""综合语言功能句型总结""]"
congcong-school_43374,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,综合语言功能句型总结,综合语言功能句型总结,选择题,基础,0.38,2,选择合适的句子表达“我们去公园吧”。,"[""Let’s going to the park."", ""Let’s go to the park."", ""Let’s goes to the park."", ""Let’s to go to the park.""]",B,建议一起去公园可以说“Let’s go to the park.”。Let’s后接动词原形。,"[""综合语言功能句型总结""]"
congcong-school_43375,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,综合语言功能句型总结,综合语言功能句型总结,填空题,基础,0.38,2,根据答句补全问句：She likes drawing. ________,,What does your sister like?,询问第三人称单数“喜欢什么”，用“What does + 主语 + like?”；助动词does后用动词原形like。,"[""综合语言功能句型总结""]"
congcong-school_43376,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,综合语言功能句型总结,综合语言功能句型总结,选择题,基础,0.38,2,你想问朋友“你昨天做了什么？”，选择正确句子。,"[""What did you do yesterday?"", ""What do you did yesterday?"", ""What are you do yesterday?"", ""What does you do yesterday?""]",A,询问过去某个时间做了什么，应使用一般过去时：“What did you do yesterday?”。did后接动词原形do。,"[""综合语言功能句型总结""]"
congcong-school_43377,congcong-school,english-g6up/lessons/english-g6up-u7-kp2.json,六年级,英语,上,综合语言功能句型总结,综合语言功能句型总结,填空题,中等,0.55,3,请用英语写出“你想要一些牛奶吗？”。,,Would you like some milk?,"提供饮品时可以用“Would you like some …?”，表示礼貌询问。肯定回答可说“Yes, please.”，婉拒可说“No, thank you.”。","[""综合语言功能句型总结""]"
